ttps://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/943d026e1af39af699a0d7104bd6cf3f324d68f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:31:02Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:31:02Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"perf(dashboard): narrow GET /api/v1/user/links to only query user links\n\nThe handler built the entire unified dashboard response (a preferences DB\nread, iterating the full Tier-1 registry, and a Tier-2 stack-apps YAML\nreload with up to 5 filesystem probe attempts) just to discard everything\nexcept the Tier-3 user links.\n\nAdd Service.GetUserLinks(ctx, userID), which goes straight to\nrepo.GetUserLinks and maps to AppItem DTOs, and have the handler call it\ndirectly instead of GetDashboardApps.","tree":{"sha":"fde60189e1325e3c9681de0418bcc65a286401f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/fde60189e1325e3c9681de0418bcc65a286401f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/943d026e1af39af699a0d7104bd6cf3f324d68f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u