ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/cf183d62c6834b3e375ccc10d942d7291d707c0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:03:00Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:03:00Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"fix(chores): compute potential points from real template values\n\nThe \"Outstanding Chores\" dashboard widget showed\ntoday_pending_count * 10 as \"potential points\", ignoring that each\nchore template has its own configurable point value (10/15/30). Any\nhousehold with a non-default-point template pending saw the wrong\nnumber.\n\nGoalProgress now sums the real points of each pending instance''s\ntemplate (using summary.today_chores joined against the already-\nfetched chore templates) instead of assuming a flat multiplier.\n\nFixes #515","tree":{"sha":"8bec6961e9ec55849d44284340d94ef87c919de7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/8bec6961e9ec55849d44284340d94ef87c919de7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/cf183d62c6834b3e375ccc10d942d7291d707c0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/cf183d62c6834b3e375ccc10d942d7291d707c0f","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKGNmMTgzZDYyYzY4MzRiM2UzNzVjY2MxMGQ5NDJkNzI5MWQ3MDdjMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3","sha":"27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3"}],"sha":"cf183d62c6834b3e375ccc10d942d7291d707c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/cf183d62c6834b3e375ccc10d942d7291d707c0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:02:53Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:02:53Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"test(chores): verify dashboard i18n keys resolve via the real hook\n\nFollow-up to the #510 fix: the chores frontend''s own component tests\nmock useTranslation''s t() to just echo back the key, which would mask\na key that fails to resolve at runtime (the exact class of bug #579\ndescribes). This exercises the real hook/LanguageProvider instead, for\nevery supported locale, confirming the new dashboard integration\nwidget keys resolve to actual localized strings and that interpolated\nvalues show up in the output.","tree":{"sha":"59404c0993b065ccdbb3cb0ef7c05aabd0081f13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/59404c0993b065ccdbb3cb0ef7c05aabd0081f13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKDI3ZWQ2YTlhMGI3YmRhMTNmMTgxNTljYzhmMmE2NGZiOGU3ODhiZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/a06ad7431a3f3899ee3a0a885f94c3132d24178c","sha":"a06ad7431a3f3899ee3a0a885f94c3132d24178c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/a06ad7431a3f3899ee3a0a885f94c3132d24178c"}],"sha":"27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/27ed6a9a0b7bda13f18159cc8f2a64fb8e788bf3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/a06ad7431a3f3899ee3a0a885f94c3132d24178c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:02:40Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:02:40Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"fix(chores): localize dashboard shopping/maintenance widget strings\n\nThe Shopping Sync and Device Maintenance dashboard widgets hardcoded\nGerman literals directly in JSX for their loading state, populated\nsummary sentence, and status badges (\"Lade Einkaufsdaten...\", \"N\noffene Artikel auf M Einkaufslisten.\", \"N OFFEN\", \"! N FÄLLIG\"), so\nEnglish and Polish users saw German text regardless of locale even\nthough every other string on the page went through t().\n\nAdded loading/summary/badge keys (with interpolation for the counts)\nto the en/de/pl chores.json resources and replaced the inline\nliterals with t() calls. Verified the new keys actually resolve (not\njust fall back to the raw key, per #579''s masking risk) via a\ndedicated test against the real useTranslation hook in\npackages/shared -- see the #510 test in\nuseTranslation.test.tsx, which asserts each key resolves to a\ndifferent string per locale and that interpolated values appear in\nthe output.\n\nAlso wires the already-fetched chore templates into GoalProgress\n(same file, one line) so it can compute real potential points (#515).\n\nFixes #510","tree":{"sha":"75df1211c22b842a5df92e2824e194f6a3d1436e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/75df1211c22b842a5df92e2824e194f6a3d1436e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/a06ad7431a3f3899ee3a0a885f94c3132d24178c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations