epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/975d905d90f7ca5381ff9902759ba2a3b5960b5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:32:01Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:32:01Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"docs: bring component and package READMEs up to date with core/household\n\nThe dashboard is now a launcher (app catalog, user links, preferences,\ntelemetry) and core/household owns households, members, roles, invites,\ncontacts and profiles (ADR 0006). Several READMEs still described the old\ndashboard-owns-everything world, or were missing the household service and\nnewer scripts/packages entirely.\n\n- root README: add budget/library to the routing tables, document\n  scripts/verify-stack.sh\n- .ai/CONTEXT.md: Active Apps Index was missing core/household, budget and\n  library, and still called workout''s frontend \"deferred\"\n- infrastructure/caddy/README.md: add the /household route, the household\n  API routes and the /internal/* denial\n- infrastructure/postgres/README.md: add alfheim_household (11 databases,\n  not 10)\n- packages/README.md, packages/shared/README.md: document the household\n  frontend/backend modules, mount_mcp, tls.py, and the full i18n/theme\n  inventory\n- scripts/README.md: document verify-stack.sh, diagnose-mcp.sh and\n  check-frontend-runtime-config.sh\n- core/household/*/README.md: add the cross-link to the reference page,\n  matching every other app README","tree":{"sha":"bc61e686de7951335d05ec38ee34ab0aef1551ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/bc61