os_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/84785a53c46308591ee4e0f3e7ed9806e0484e1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:28:07Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:28:07Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"fix(chat): report a 404 from an MCP endpoint as a configuration error\n\nA 404 from the configured MCP URL now wraps ErrEndpointNotFound, whose\nmessage points at the CHAT_MCP_SERVERS path, so the startup diagnostic''s\n\"offline or degraded\" warning says what to fix. Reachability semantics are\nunchanged: a 404 is still reported as not reachable.","tree":{"sha":"e6334d210591430b94b77d116c3543861d678193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/e6334d210591430b94b77d116c3543861d678193"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/84785a53c46308591ee4e0f3e7ed9806e0484e1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/84785a53c46308591ee4e0f3e7ed9806e0484e1e","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKDg0Nzg1YTUzYzQ2MzA4NTkxZWU0ZTBmM2U3ZWQ5ODA2ZTA0ODRlMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/8881102caf7dac03023080a00d217f255abcc8c6","sha":"8881102caf7dac03023080a00d217f255abcc8c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/8881102caf7dac03023080a00d217f255abcc8c6"}],"sha":"84785a53c46308591ee4e0f3e7ed9806e0484e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/84785a53c46308591ee4e0f3e7ed9806e0484e1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/8881102caf7dac03023080a00d217f255abcc8c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:28:07Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:28:07Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"fix(mcp): mount FastMCP at /mcp with its own lifespan\n\nEvery MCP-exposing backend (pantry, chores, maintenance, budget, library,\nworkout) did app.mount(\"/mcp\", mcp.http_app()), but http_app() already\nserves its endpoint at /mcp, so the real endpoint was /mcp/mcp. POST /mcp\nwas redirected to /mcp/ (404 once authenticated), and /mcp/mcp failed with\n\"Task group is not initialized\" because the FastAPI lifespan ran\nmcp.lifespan() instead of the http app''s lifespan, so the Streamable HTTP\nsession manager never started. The chat backend could not call any tool.\n\nAdd backend_shared.mcp_middleware.mount_mcp(app, mcp, settings=...), which\nregisters the MCP app as a plain route at exactly /mcp (no Mount, no slash\nredirect, no doubled path) behind MCPAuthenticationMiddleware, and returns\nthe MCP app so each lifespan runs mcp_app.router.lifespan_context(mcp_app).\n\nAdd testing helpers mcp_membership() and mcp_list_tools(), plus a per-app\ntransport test that runs the real lifespan and performs initialize +\ntools/list against /mcp (200 + tools), and checks 401 without a token and\n400 without X-Household-ID.","tree":{"sha":"b1529ba639ae53072e71b9835fced79c879648db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/b1529ba639ae53072e71b9835fced79c879648db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/8881102caf7dac03023080a00d217f255abcc8c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/user