te":"2026-09-19T08:47:28Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"fix(shopping): list households from the household app\n\nThe dashboard no longer serves /api/v1/households/me (#479). get_lists and\nGET /api/v1/households/me now call the household app''s public API at\n{HOUSEHOLD_INTERNAL_URL}/api/v1/households/me (base URL from the shared\nmembership client) with the caller''s bearer token, and expose role and\nis_default. If the household app cannot answer, get_lists falls back to the\nalready-authorized active household only and the proxy returns an empty\nlist. The unused DASHBOARD_BACKEND_URL lookup is removed. Tests serve the\nhousehold API from an in-memory httpx.MockTransport.","tree":{"sha":"559039435ec3410e6674eead3ca43a5e78d8691e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/559039435ec3410e6674eead3ca43a5e78d8691e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/e118c0fb93df095ea7504d503c6fc7d97beff089","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":