ehold-ui): use shared household store for the active household\n\nlib/activeHousehold delegates to the shared store, so the app writes the\nsame key and dispatches the same storage-household-changed event as the\nprovider. Leaving/deleting a household and changing the default announce a\nmembership change so every mounted HouseholdProvider reloads its list (new\nhouseholds from create/join are picked up as unknown ids). The API client\nsends X-Household-ID via the shared helper.","tree":{"sha":"dd1a8f95e928abeef715ea4b84922765d59251bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/dd1a8f95e928abeef715ea4b84922765d59251bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/54924ed8817c29a95be92719aafb669150f52cc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/54924ed8817c29a95be92719aafb669150f52cc6","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKDU0OTI0ZWQ4ODE3YzI5YTk1YmU5Mjcx