"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/81302066eec4fd6baf884daf89acfc66b9d39ac3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T08:44:38Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T08:44:38Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"refactor(chores): use shared household context\n\nAuthorize every chore route with backend_shared.household.require_household\nand drop the app-local get_current_user_and_home/get_current_household_id\nwrappers. Completing a chore always records the authenticated caller''s user\nid: the client-supplied completed_by field is removed from the request.\nMCP tools read the household and user exclusively from\nget_mcp_household_context(); the uuid5(NAMESPACE_DNS, household_id) phantom\nhousehold and the uuid5 user fallback are removed (assignees use the shared\nderive_user_id mapping). main.py configures household auth and closes the\nmembership client on shutdown. Tests stub memberships with\noverride_membership and cover 403 household_forbidden, 400\nhousehold_required/household_invalid, 401 and 503.","tree":{"sha":"6f6115275c5613c01673a53023dd2e7e718f2247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/6f6115275c5613c01673a53023dd2e7e718f2247"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/81302066eec4fd6baf884daf89acfc66b9d39ac3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/81302066eec4fd6baf884daf89acfc66b9d39ac3","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKDgxMzAyMDY2ZWVjNGZkNmJhZjg4NGRhZjg5YWNmYzY2YjlkMzlhYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/7e9508a0b5423a36e6637a63ad7a404e6c2922a6","sha":"7e9508a0b5423a36e6637a63ad7a404e6c2922a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/7e9508a0b5423a36e6637a63ad7a404e6c2922a6"}],"sha":"81302066eec4fd6baf884daf89acfc66b9d39ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/81302066eec4fd6baf884daf89acfc66b9d39ac3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/7e9508a0b5423a36e6637a63ad7a404e6c2922a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T08:44:38Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T08:44:38Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"refactor(shopping): use shared household context\n\nAuthorize every shopping-list, item and history route with\nbackend_shared.household.require_household (membership confirmed by the\nhousehold app) and drop the app-local get_current_user_and_home wrapper.\nThe Pantry client now always sends X-Household-ID and forwards the caller''s\nbearer token so Pantry authorizes the caller itself. main.py configures\nhousehold auth and closes the membership client on shutdown. Tests stub\nmemberships with override_membership and cover 403 household_forbidden\n(including the inter-service push endpoint), 400 household_required and\nhousehold_invalid, 401 and 503.","tree":{"sha":"1967d44172f843ae69959b46b1ebd0d90a9ef03d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/1967d44172f843ae69959b46b1ebd0d90a9ef03d"},