oegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/b43ce01507607a6baefed0298b1ab995239db822/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T08:44:38Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T08:44:38Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"refactor(pantry): use shared household context\n\nAuthorize every route with backend_shared.household.require_household so\nmembership is confirmed by the household app instead of trusting JWT claims.\nMCP tools no longer accept household_id/user_id arguments and read the\nhousehold exclusively from get_mcp_household_context(); the inventory tools''\nuuid5(NAMESPACE_DNS, household_id) phantom-household derivation is removed.\nThe shopping push client always forwards the caller''s bearer token and\nX-Household-ID. main.py configures household auth and closes the membership\nclient on shutdown. Tests stub memberships with override_membership and cover\n403 household_forbidden, 400 household_required/household_invalid, 401 and 503.","tree":{"sha":"9001beb9656b7b0c0b7f4bb17fd60c35c540a284","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/9001beb9656b7b0c0b7f4bb17fd6