/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/ee221b5bf405a5bf326608aa917252c32de7cb90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:50:42Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:50:42Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"refactor(shopping-ui): use shared household context\n\nSelecting a list no longer writes the list''s home_id into the global active\nhousehold (Sidebar, ListSelector); only the shared switcher changes it. The\npage, Einlagern modal and household pickers read the active household and\nmemberships from the shared provider instead of localStorage and a separate\nhouseholds/me query. List and history queries include the household id in\ntheir keys and wait for a ready household; a remembered list is only used\nwhile it belongs to the current household''s lists. Pantry sync builds its\nexplicit target header with householdHeaders. ShoppingErrorBanner no longer\ncalls a 403 an expired session (household errors go to HouseholdGate,\nother 403s show an access-denied message). Pages are wrapped in\nHouseholdGate.","tree":{"sha":"ebac536ffb5c0b7972282a1cf7e45587dae92e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/ebac536ffb5