outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:44:00Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"refactor(budget): drop forked auth in favor of shared household context\n\nRemove src/core/auth.py (TenantContext/get_current_tenant, its own\nPyJWKClient cache and JWT-claim household matching). Routers now depend on\nbackend_shared.household.require_household, so membership is confirmed by the\nhousehold app. Settings gain expected_issuer/jwks_url (OIDC_JWKS_URL override)\nas required by the shared decode_oidc_token, main.py calls\nconfigure_household_auth and closes the membership client on shutdown.\n\nMCP tools no longer accept a household_id argument; they read the household\nfrom get_mcp_household_context(), which MCPAuthenticationMiddleware fills.\n\nTests use a StaticMembershipLookup via the shared testing helpers and cover\ncross-tenant 403, missing/invalid header 400, 401 and 503 fail-closed.","tree":{"sha":"d767e13926f739e2660d8ce466a27c0590022f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/d767e13926f739e2660d8ce466a27c0590022f33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/570917a47d9ee23a4c5413e16ec57027f21e275c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_u