on shutdown.\nTests use override_household/override_membership and cover 400/401/403/503.","tree":{"sha":"c502f0251ccf529aa9547e065624b8cfbd86605e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/c502f0251ccf529aa9547e065624b8cfbd86605e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/eba096fc26baf29049b7e4a876ef12422169de54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/eba096fc26baf29049b7e4a876ef12422169de54","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKGViYTA5NmZjMjZiYWYyOTA0OWI3ZTRhODc2ZWYxMjQyMjE2OWRlNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/540b2fe5a7e0337e52fd4d40ee432ecc3c389cb7","sha":"540b2fe5a7e0337e52fd4d40ee432ecc3c389cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/540b2fe5a7e0337e52fd4d40ee432ecc3c389cb7"}],"sha":"eba096fc26baf29049b7e4a876ef12422169de54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/eba096fc26baf29049b7e4a876ef12422169de54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/585bc50bff166705304bb7ef017dc9252a320378/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:40:01Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:40:01Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"refactor(pantry-ui): use shared household context\n\nSend X-Household-ID via the shared header helper and report household\nerrors to the provider; drop the local useActiveHouseholdId hook. Inventory,\nledger, product, category and location queries include the household id in\ntheir keys and wait for a ready household. The layout wraps pages in\nHouseholdGate; the chat context and the low-stock push to shopping use the\nshared active household.","tree":{"sha":"41ec81183844a0061d85fdec2a14e7fede50f29d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/41ec81183844a0061d85fdec2a14e7fede50f29d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/585bc50bff166705304bb7ef017dc9252a320378","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/585bc50bff166705304bb7ef017dc9252a320378","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKDU4NWJjNTBiZmYxNjY3MDUzMDRiYjdlZjAxN2RjOTI1MmEzMjAzNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/3789c67feb762f1638440bc8d874a1468aebbca2","sha":"3789c67feb762f1638440bc8d874a1468aebbca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/3789c67feb762f1638440bc8d874a1468aebbca2"}],"sha":"585bc50bff166705304bb7ef017dc9252a320378","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/585bc50bff166705304bb7ef017dc9252a320378"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commits/330a63d1e785a855ac0fd840968df92007aff328/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:39:28Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:39:28Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"feat(chat): verify household membership via core/household\n\nReplace the JWT household-claim check (Zitadel never issues those\nclaims) with a membership lookup against core/household''s internal API:\nGET {HOUSEHOLD_INTERNAL_URL}/internal/v1/memberships/{householdId}/{sub}\nwith the ALFHEIM_INTERNAL_TOKEN service token.\n\n- New householdclient package: positive cache 30 s, negative cache 5 s,\n  errors never cached, 3 s timeout, response validated (ids, role).\n- RequireHousehold middleware on all chat API routes: missing header ->\n  400 household_required, non-UUID -> 400 household_invalid, not a\n  member -> 403 household_forbidden, lookup failure -> 503\n  household_service_unavailable (never fails open). Errors use\n  {\"detail\":{\"code\",\"message\"}}. HouseholdID (uuid), Role and Subject\n  are stored in the request context; realm_access role parsing removed.\n- ALFHEIM_INTERNAL_TOKEN is required at startup.\n- Conversations are scoped by owner AND household; a conversation cannot\n  be read, continued or deleted from another household.\n- The tool loop uses the request context (credentials, cancellation) for\n  LLM rounds and MCP calls and stops when the client goes away; DB\n  writes are detached via context.WithoutCancel.\n- MCP diagnostics probe servers as the caller; toggling the global MCP\n  registry requires OWNER or ADMIN.","tree":{"sha":"0960e8e9276642fe3f2672324ced154f037f9567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/0960e8e9276642fe3f2672324ced154f037f9567"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/330a63d1e785a855ac0fd840968df92007aff328","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/commit/330a63d1e785a855ac0fd840968df92007aff328","node_id":"C_kwDOSdRjLtoAKDMzMGE2M2QxZTc4NWE4NTVhYzBmZDg0MDk2OGRmOTIwMDdhZmYzMjg","pa