-09-18T16:37:04Z","email":"Leif.kr@outlook.com","name":"Leif"},"message":"feat(shared): household provider and gate\n\nAdd HouseholdProvider/useActiveHousehold (status, householdId, role,\nhouseholds, setActiveHousehold) on top of GET /api/v1/households/me with\nis_default-then-first selection, localStorage + storage-household-changed\nsync across tabs/apps and refetch when another app announces an unknown\nhousehold. Add householdHeaders/applyHouseholdHeaders (X-Household-ID only),\nhousehold error-code parsing/reporting and HouseholdGate (onboarding card,\nswitch on household_forbidden/required/invalid, retry on 503) with EN/DE/PL\nstrings. AppShell mounts the provider; HouseholdSwitcher uses it.","tree":{"sha":"b97bd25e54c81ca9199fe4864e78fccea525a359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/trees/b97bd25e54c81ca9199fe4864e78fccea525a359"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KroegerLeif/Alfheim/git/commits/3789c67feb762f1638440bc8d874a1468aebbca2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174730541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KroegerLeif","id":174730541,"login":"KroegerLeif","node_id":"U_kgDOCmotLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KroegerLeif/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht