mail.com","name":"Nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T14:35:27Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"fix(openapi): burn down 7 parity mismatches (66 → 59 ignored)\n\nAdd OpenAPI specs for 7 routes that the CLI/MCP server depend on:\n\n- DELETE /api/agents/{id}/memory — agent memory clear\n- GET /api/tokens/by-agent — per-agent cost breakdown\n- POST /api/tokens/rotate — API key rotation\n- POST /api/agents/register — agent self-registration\n- PATCH /api/auth/me — self-service profile update\n- GET /api/tasks/outcomes — task outcome analytics\n- GET /api/tasks/regression — regression comparison metrics\n\nRemove corresponding entries from the parity ignore list.","tree":{"sha":"c71dd8e67614ced22ac9b919dc9dd80d104d832c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADN-MAN/Mission-control/git/trees/c71dd8e67614ced22ac9b919dc9dd80d104d832c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADN-MAN/Mission-control/git/commits/7994aa6c6ccbc928ae8f64692ee299e81f0a8da5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"pub