,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T22:48:28Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"chore: log round 9 (224 new tests + 2 bug fixes)","tree":{"sha":"970c7e3cccbbdf14163fda47dcd5013cf6b88707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/970c7e3cccbbdf14163fda47dcd5013cf6b88707"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/8319cc2c7af3dd66f2af744729e0f668e4638077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/8319cc2c7af3dd66f2af744729e0f668e4638077","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDgzMTljYzJjN2FmM2RkNjZmMmFmNzQ0NzI5ZTBmNjY4ZTQ2MzgwNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d","sha":"38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d"}],"sha":"8319cc2c7af3dd66f2af744729e0f668e4638077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/8319cc2c7af3dd66f2af744729e0f668e4638077"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T22:47:40Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T22:47:40Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"test(round 9) + fix: 5 parallel test agents → 224 new tests + 2 real bugs fixed\n\nCoordinated 5 parallel subagents covering panel parts that had ZERO or\nweak test coverage. Each wrote to its own file; I ran all, fixed two\nreal bugs surfaced by the agents, and re-verified everything green.\n\n## Test files written (224 new tests, all passing)\n\n  panel-api/test/round9-auth-projects.test.ts        (~60 tests)\n    auth.ts + middleware.ts + ratelimit.ts +\n    routes/auth.ts (login, logout, me, profile, change-password) +\n    routes/projects.ts (CRUD, multi-tenant isolation, optimistic locking,\n                       body-size limit, cascade delete)\n\n  panel-api/test/round9-shares-public.test.ts        (~76 tests)\n    routes/shares.ts (owner-side create/revoke/resnapshot, Nachtrag\n                     chain, comment-counts aggregation) +\n    routes/public.ts (token gate, password gate w/ bcrypt+argon2,\n                     5/15min rate-limit, expiry/revocation 410,\n                     approve/changes/reject, sentinel leak guards,\n                     viewCount tracking) +\n    snapshot.ts deeper (server recomputes ep/gp, internal-field strip) +\n    audit.ts deeper (genesis prevHash, tamper-detection-index reporting,\n                    concurrent writers)\n\n  panel-api/test/round9-misc-routes.test.ts          (~60 tests)\n    routes/inbox.ts (multi-tenant, sort by activity, revoked exclusion) +\n    routes/notifications.ts (unread count, mark-viewed, digest endpoint) +\n    routes/presets.ts (CRUD, multi-tenant) +\n    routes/templates.ts (CRUD, cents↔euros, use-count bump, order)+\n    lib/mailer.ts (disabled mode, payload-shape contract, no env leak)\n\n  panel-api/test/round9-lib-edges.test.ts            (~28 tests)\n    ratelimit.ts deeper (1000-key cleanup, burst-then-reset, Retry-After) +\n    aufmass.ts deeper (multi-line + comments, German decimal-comma, 200-line\n                      stress, all 4 operators) +\n    snapshot.ts deeper (order stability, hash hex64 format, sentinel) +\n    db.ts (migrations idempotent, FK pragma on, every Round-7 table present)+\n    mailer.ts disabled paths +\n    pdf.ts smoke (Buffer w/ %PDF- magic, no internal-field leak)\n\n  src/pages/__tests__/Login.test.tsx                  (~14 tests)\n    form rendering, type attributes, happy-path navigate, error chips for\n    401/400/500/network, loading state, already-auth''d redirect, password\n    manager friendly autocomplete\n\n  src/pages/panel/__tests__/PanelLayout.test.tsx      (~13 tests)\n    6 nav entries, \"BALD\" badge on Archiv, unread chip, logout,\n    sidebar+theme localStorage persistence, mobile drawer,\n    hotkeys (/, ⌘K, g+p), force-password modal + global-hotkey gate\n\n  src/pages/panel/__tests__/PanelHome.test.tsx        (~9 tests)\n    greeting, empty states, recent-projects cap, error chips\n\n  src/pages/panel/__tests__/CommandPalette.test.tsx   (~13 tests)\n    open/close, search filter, \"Keine Treffer\", arrow + enter selection,\n    backdrop close, mouse hover highlight\n\n  src/features/kalkulation/__tests__/ProjectsList.test.tsx (~15 tests)\n    header + CTA, pluralization, loading skeleton, ?new=1 auto-modal,\n    create/delete flow w/ confirm, list error toast\n\n## Real bugs found and FIXED in this commit (caught by Round 9 tests)\n\n1. routes/shares.ts (POST /projects/:id/shares) was echoing the plaintext\n   password back in the response body. The route correctly hashed it into\n   passwordHash and stripped it from `settingsToStore` for DB persistence\n   — but the response returned `parsed.data.settings` (the raw request),\n   which still contained the plaintext. That plaintext would land in HTTP\n   access logs + reverse-proxy logs. Fixed: return `settingsToStore`.\n\n2. lib/audit.ts had a documented \"single-process safe\" caveat — under\n   Promise.all of concurrent recordAuditEvent calls, two writers would\n   read the same tip-hash and produce sibling rows that fork the chain;\n   verifyAuditChain then reported a broken row. Fixed with a chained-promise\n   in-process mutex (`withAuditLock`). For a multi-instance deploy this\n   would still need a row-level lock (SELECT FOR UPDATE / BEGIN IMMEDIATE);\n   that caveat is documented on the new helper.\n\nBoth fixes verified by un-skipping the two `test.skip(\"FAILS: real bug\")`\ntests Agent 2 had documented — both now pass green.\n\n## Totals\n\n  Before Round 9:  frontend 508 + panel-api 95 = 603 tests\n  After Round 9:   frontend 572 + panel-api 319 = 891 tests   (+288)\n  Lint: 0 errors. tsc clean both sides. Build 4,12 s.\n\nAll 224 new tests pass. The bump of +288 over baseline includes some\nproperty-test cases reported as multiple by the runner.","tree":{"sha":"0977776c4cf0a3628346af8a35b99bbbe63d8042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/0977776c4cf0a3628346af8a35b99bbbe63d8042"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDM4MDI5Yzk4NWRhNjU5ZDdhNTZlM2MyMjE2MDIyZWFhOTkwMjQ4NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/a772621c42b440716122a7c4bfd44a4843d706f2","sha":"a772621c42b440716122a7c4bfd44a4843d706f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/a772621c42b440716122a7c4bfd44a4843d706f2"}],"sha":"38029c985da659d7a56e3c2216022eaa9902486d","url":"https://api.github.com/r