,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/a772621c42b440716122a7c4bfd44a4843d706f2","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKGE3NzI2MjFjNDJiNDQwNzE2MTIyYTdjNGJmZDQ0YTQ4NDNkNzA2ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167","sha":"09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167"}],"sha":"a772621c42b440716122a7c4bfd44a4843d706f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/a772621c42b440716122a7c4bfd44a4843d706f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T22:25:08Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T22:25:08Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"test(round 8): +186 new tests (frontend 349→508, panel-api 68→95)\n\nTargeted gaps left after Round 7:\n  - calc.ts had no property-based tests\n  - Firmen.tsx + Firma.tsx had 0% frontend test coverage\n  - preisanfrage client had thin error-path / mapping coverage\n  - URL paths could regress to /api/v1/* silently\n\nFiles added:\n  - panel-api/test/firmen-round8.test.ts (+27 tests)\n      ● mock-mode env parsing edge cases (true/TRUE/1/yes/on; 0/false/no/off)\n      ● cache TTL eviction (clear → re-fetches)\n      ● structuredClone isolation (mutating mock data doesn''t poison next call)\n      ● URL path regression (asserts /api/companies, NOT /api/v1/*)\n      ● getProjectPositions snake→camel mapping + isHeader inference\n      ● listExternalProjects full field mapping\n      ● PreisanfrageError preserves status + body on non-JSON 500\n      ● 403 from admin endpoint propagates with body\n      ● firma_calc_defaults basis-points + cents round-trip without drift\n      ● composite-PK enforcement on (preisanfrage_firma_id, firma_kind)\n      ● JWT leak guard — env JWT never in any client return value or error message\n\n  - src/pages/panel/__tests__/Firmen.test.tsx (+17 tests)\n      ● loading / 0-row / 1-row / 10-row rendering\n      ● DEMO badge appears iff isMock=true\n      ● search filter by displayName + folderName\n      ● filter tabs Alle / Verwaltet / Nur extern\n      ● \"Neu — Setup ausstehend\" badge logic\n      ● \"Eigene Defaults\" badge\n      ● error states for 503 integration_disabled, 503 upstream, 500\n      ● XSS / sentinel-leak guard\n\n  - src/pages/panel/__tests__/Firma.test.tsx (+12 tests)\n      ● header renders master data\n      ● invalid URL renders error\n      ● 404 friendly message\n      ● defaults form pre-populates from API\n      ● isCustom hint + KALKU-Globalwerte hint\n      ● Speichern calls api.updateDefaults with decoded decimals\n      ● Auschreibungen list renders + sort\n      ● \"Kalkulation starten\" on managed firma — cascades Firma overrides\n        into calcParams + seeds positions (12-assertion deep check)\n      ● \"Kalkulation starten\" on external firma skips positions fetch\n      ● Position fetch failure non-fatal — project still created\n      ● Reset asks confirm + DELETEs\n\n  - src/features/kalkulation/__tests__/calc.property.test.ts (+130 tests)\n      ● Cartesian product (6 position samples × 5 param samples × 4 invariants)\n        → 120 invariant tests\n      ● Header rows return all zeros regardless of inputs\n      ● Mobilbauzaun canonical case (formula audit anchor)\n      ● Gesellchen overrides — Material=2, Menge=100 → EP=2,36\n      ● recalcAll preserves inputs + calculates EP/GP\n      ● calcTotals: sum GP = totalNetto (within rounding tolerance)\n      ● calcTotals: totalMwst = totalNetto × MwSt\n      ● Header rows don''t contribute to totals\n      ● visibleIds filter constrains visibleNetto\n      ● zeitabzug=10 makes epLohn 110% of base\n\nFixed during test development:\n  - preisanfrage-fixture.ts isMockMode now accepts {true,TRUE,1,yes,on}\n    truthy + {0,false,no,off} falsy with whitespace tolerance\n  - Property tests caught two-step rounding subtlety: GP can drift up to\n    quantity × 0,005 + 0,005 from quantity × EP. Documented bound in test.\n\nTotals: frontend 349 → 508 (+159 tests, including the 130 property-test\ncombos counted by vitest as individual cases). panel-api 68 → 95 (+27).\nLint 0 errors. Build 3,87 s.","tree":{"sha":"f1017e10699baea8f2e857e8941fa91dbeff8af6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/f1017e10699baea8f2e857e8941fa91dbeff8af6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDA5ZTdlNTJkNTczODc3YzMzMWRhYzY3MDY4ZjQxNzQwYjVkODkxNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/15c0092db5c0e294f4744ea5f41ea5bcab5e5557","sha":"15c0092db5c0e294f4744ea5f41ea5bcab5e5557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/15c0092db5c0e294f4744ea5f41ea5bcab5e5557"}],"sha":"09e7e52d573877c331dac67068f41740b5d89167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolch