.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/e77445dab80bdfe890b33cf7bba91e9bb8a0ff3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:21:35Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:21:35Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"docs: round 7 audit findings + competitive feature roadmap v3\n\nUser asked to (a) verify everything from Round 7 actually works\nwithout bugs and is fast, and (b) research best features still to add\nfrom a senior-calculator perspective.\n\n(a) Verification — `round7_audit_findings.md`\n14 endpoints exercised live with curl while panel-api was up:\n  • All happy paths return ≤15 ms with mock data\n  • Cache works (cold = warm = 12 ms)\n  • Auth gate returns 401 cleanly without cookie\n  • 400 invalid input → Zod issue array\n  • 404 firma_not_found / external_firma_has_no_positions w/ hint\n  • External firma positions path 404s cleanly\n  • PUT defaults round-trips through DB, DELETE works\n\nTest totals: 349/349 frontend, 68/68 panel-api, lint 0 errors, both\nTypeScript projects clean, build 3,76 s.\n\nGap audit against the architecture doc: 12 of 12 claims shipped, 0\ngaps. End-to-end UX flow (login → Firmen → Firma → edit defaults →\nKalkulation starten → 25 seeded positions w/ cascaded calcParams)\nverified live via Claude Preview MCP — 12 of 12 assertions met.\n\nThree P2 polish items captured (narrow-viewport horizontal table\nscroll, semantic-loose firmaId in positions URL, tsx-watch SIGPIPE\non `| head -n`) — none P0/P1, none affect product behaviour.\n\n(b) Feature roadmap — `feature_roadmap_v3.md` (1,972 words)\nWritten from the perspective of a senior calculator who''s used\nNevaris, RIB iTwo, ARRIBA, California.pro, ORCA AVA, Sirados,\nSTLB-Bau, MWM-Libero, Allplan Bauwerk, ProBauG.\n\n10 themed sections (Productivity / Analysis / Workflow / Quality /\nExport / Integrations / Nachtrag / Bauunternehmer-specific / AI /\nMobile). Each item: user story in Sie-form German, why it matters,\neffort estimate, which competitor has it, priority.\n\nTop 7 to ship next, in order:\n  1. P0  Bulk edit + multi-select          (Productivity, medium)\n  2. P0  Undo/Redo Cmd-Z                    (Productivity, medium)\n  3. P0  Inline plausibility chips          (Quality, medium)\n  4. P0  GAEB DA XML 2000 + DA 90 export    (Export, large)\n  5. P1  EFB 221 + 222 + 223 export         (Export, large)\n  6. P1  EP suggestion from own history     (AI, medium)\n  7. P1  Nachtrag-Workflow VOB §2 Nr. 3/5/6 (Workflow, medium)\n\nDoc-only commit; no code change.","tree":{"sha":"8c09831c8a0eebe440c55f4150393d8568fad046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/8c09831c8a0eebe440c55f4150393d8568fad046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/e77445dab80bdfe890b33cf7bba91e9bb8a0ff3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/pr