ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/6088d3444a1ffd8ef232978f8f0b6bb33cb2fc79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:07:16Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:07:16Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"chore: log live verification + round-7 progress doc","tree":{"sha":"3d6ddc3b5e9f43586efc28c2f805fa04bb57d504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/3d6ddc3b5e9f43586efc28c2f805fa04bb57d504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/6088d3444a1ffd8ef232978f8f0b6bb33cb2fc79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/6088d3444a1ffd8ef232978f8f0b6bb33cb2fc79","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDYwODhkMzQ0NGExZmZkOGVmMjMyOTc4ZjhmMGI2YmIzM2NiMmZjNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42","sha":"1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42"}],"sha":"6088d3444a1ffd8ef232978f8f0b6bb33cb2fc79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/6088d3444a1ffd8ef232978f8f0b6bb33cb2fc79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:06:30Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:06:30Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"docs: round 7 progress + live verification report\n\nDrove the full Phase 1a+1b+1c flow via Claude Preview MCP in a real\nChromium browser against panel-api + Vite dev:\n  login → /panel/firmen (table of 10 firms + DEMO badge) →\n  Gesellchen GmbH → edit defaults (18%/15%/72,51/0,5) → save →\n  reload (form re-renders with saved values) →\n  click \"Kalkulation starten\" on Ludwigschule →\n  /panel/kalkulation/:newId with 25 seeded positions and the\n  Firma-cascaded calcParams.\n\n12/12 assertions met, including:\n  - calcParams.materialZuschlag = 0.18 (Firma override, not global 0.12)\n  - calcParams.verrechnungslohn = 72.51 (Firma override, not global 49.9)\n  - Mobilbauzaun position arrives at quantity=100, unit=\"m\" (NOT 100000\n    — keeps the formula-audit baseline clean for the next iteration)\n  - 25 positions seeded from preisanfrage mock GAEB parse\n\nDoc lists per-phase deliverables, deferred work (Firma chip on existing\nprojects, Submissionsergebnis enrichment, adopt endpoint, webhooks),\ntest totals (68 panel-api + 349 frontend), and all 5 commit SHAs from\nthis round.\n\nHit one bug during verification: tsx watch panel-api crashed silently\nwhen piped through `head -30`. Fixed by restarting without the pipe.\nAlready-documented panel-api dev recipe stays unchanged; the lesson is\nnotes-to-self in WORK_LOG.","tree":{"sha":"11818f0b58008371382381e925eab133df908d38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/11818f0b58008371382381e925eab133df908d38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDFiMTI1ZDQ5ZmYyYzA2ZGYyNzE5MjdiMmMwODkwNDlhZDExNWNjNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1","sha":"f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1"}],"sha":"1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/1b125d49ff2c06df271927b2c089049ad115cc42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:51:13Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:51:13Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"feat(panel): Phase 1c — seed Kalkulation positions from preisanfrage GAEB\n\n\"Kalkulation starten\" used to create an empty project — calculator still\nhad to upload the GAEB. Now it pulls the GAEB-parsed positions straight\nfrom preisanfrage and pre-fills the LV.\n\nFlow:\n  1. User clicks \"Kalkulation starten\" on a managed-firma Auschreibung\n  2. Frontend fetches GET /api/panel/firmen/managed/:firmaId/projects/:projectId/positions\n  3. Backend calls preisanfrage GET /api/v1/projects/:id (which includes\n     positions[] from preisanfrage''s GAEB-parsed cache)\n  4. Each row mapped to a kalku-website Position with sortOrder, sectionPath\n     derived from OZ hierarchy, EK cells empty (= calculator''s input)\n  5. Project created with seeded positions + Firma calcParams cascaded\n  6. Toast: \"Kalkulation mit 25 Positionen aus preisanfrage angelegt.\"\n\nExternal firmas don''t have positions in preisanfrage yet (only submission\nresults) so the route 404s and the frontend falls back to empty[] — the\ncalculator imports the GAEB manually.\n\nNew code:\n- panel-api/src/lib/preisanfrage.ts — PreisanfragePosition type +\n  getProjectPositions() function. Mock-aware (returns from fixture in\n  dev mode). 60 s cache.\n- panel-api/src/lib/preisanfrage-fixture.ts — MOCK_PROJECT_POSITIONS for\n  4 projects: Ludwigschule Sanierung Sandsteinmauer (25 BOQ rows\n  including the canonical Mobilbauzaun 01.01.004 row at quantity=100,\n  NOT 100000 — keeps the formula-audit baseline clean), Grünpflege\n  Saarbrücken, MPB Bau Dieblich, Schwarzkopf PV Bitburg.\n- panel-api/src/routes/firmen.ts — GET /firmen/:kind/:firmaId/projects/:projectId/positions\n  with explicit 404 for external firmas + clear hint message.\n- src/lib/api.ts — typed api.firmen.projectPositions().\n- src/pages/panel/Firma.tsx — ProjectsCard now takes firmaId so it can\n  call the positions endpoint; non-fatal fallback to empty[] if seed\n  fails (logged but doesn''t block project creation).\n\nTests: 2 new mock-mode tests\n  - Ludwigschule mock has >10 positions, Mobilbauzaun at quantity 100,\n    ≥4 header rows\n  - Unknown projectId returns []\n\nVerified: panel-api 68/68, frontend 349/349, lint 0 errors, build 3,75 s.\n\nDemo loop now closed:\n  /panel/firmen → Gesellchen → Ludwigschule → \"Kalkulation starten\"\n  → /panel/kalkulation/:newId with 25 pre-filled positions, calcParams\n  inherited from any custom Firma defaults, bidder = \"Gesellchen GmbH\".","tree":{"sha":"295eccfcb4bd7c7377645b92078e8b16e96d2af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/295eccfcb4bd7c7377645b92078e8b16e96d2af4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKGY4YzcxY2NjMjgxODQ5YjIzMWJmOTgwYjQwM2VkOTM4YTE3NjNhYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569","sha":"530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569"}],"sha":"f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/f8c71ccc281849b231bf980b403ed938a1763ab1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:45:10Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:45:10Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"feat(panel): Phase 1b — dev mock fixture + \"Kalkulation starten\" wiring\n\nTwo big quality-of-life additions that make Phase 1a actually usable:\n\n1) MOCK FIXTURE for dev (panel-api/src/lib/preisanfrage-fixture.ts)\n   - 10 realistic firmas seeded from the real OneDrive layout\n     (Gesellchen, MPB Bau, Schwarzkopf, GTM Bauservice, Doga GaLaBau,\n     Justus Tiefbau, Wärme Wimmer, PK Brandschutz, Schmoll + Sohn,\n     Allround Sonnenschutz) — folder names match KT01 - Documents/\n   - 7 realistic Auschreibungen (Gesellchen has 4: Ludwigschule,\n     Grünpflege Saarbrücken, Krankenhaus Ludwigshafen, IGS Worms;\n     MPB Bau 2; Schwarzkopf 1; plus 2 external w/ Submissionsergebnis)\n   - Auto-activates in dev mode when NODE_ENV != production AND no\n     PREISANFRAGE_SERVICE_JWT is set. So `npm run dev` works out of\n     the box. Explicit PREISANFRAGE_MOCK=0 disables (for testing real\n     upstream from dev); PREISANFRAGE_MOCK=fixture forces on.\n   - DEMO badge in the Firmen page header when isMock=true so the user\n     never confuses fixtures for real data.\n\n2) \"KALKULATION STARTEN\" wiring (src/pages/panel/Firma.tsx)\n   - Each Auschreibung row now has a primary-coloured button\n   - Click → POST /api/panel/projects with all the Firma+Auschreibung\n     data pre-filled:\n       bidder      = Firma display name\n       calcParams  = global defaults ← cascaded ← Firma defaults\n       client      = Auftraggeber\n       name        = Auschreibung title\n       tenderNumber = projectNumber\n       deadline    = submission_date[T submission_time]\n       notes       = \"Aus preisanfrage importiert — Firma: X, Ref: Y\"\n   - Navigates to /panel/kalkulation/:id so the calculator can start\n     entering positions immediately\n   - Phase 1c (next iteration) will add \"Positionen aus preisanfrage\n     holen\" — fetch the GAEB-parsed positions instead of empty []\n\n3) Tests: 2 new mock-mode tests (auto-on in dev, explicit-off overrides).\n   Updated the existing \"503 when JWT missing\" test to also force\n   PREISANFRAGE_MOCK=0. All 66 panel-api tests pass; all 349 frontend\n   vitest tests pass; lint 0 errors; build 3,83 s.\n\nHow to demo: with no setup beyond `npm run dev`, visit /panel/firmen.\nYou''ll see the 10 firms with realistic counts. Click Gesellchen GmbH,\nedit the Material-Zuschlag to 0,18 + Verrechnungslohn to 72,51, save,\nthen click \"Kalkulation starten\" on Ludwigschule — the new project\nopens with those exact defaults already applied as calcParams.","tree":{"sha":"4d265e0723c73365f2533485d9571a80aef2bb4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/4d265e0723c73365f2533485d9571a80aef2bb4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDUzMGFlNTZhZjAzZmVlYmIwZmJlZDQwMGQ3NDYyMWQ3Y2U2YWE1Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256","sha":"464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256"}],"sha":"530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/530ae56af03feebb0fbed400d74621d7ce6aa569"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:34:59Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:34:59Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"chore: log Firma integration Phase 1a iteration","tree":{"sha":"d0080e5818a46d1f0d61a9604cd72abf2b74cc36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/d0080e5818a46d1f0d61a9604cd72abf2b74cc36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDQ2NGY5OTUxZjkwYzFmMDgzNDE3YzMxYTY5MzdkMDkwYWUyYjYyNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e","sha":"d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e"}],"sha":"464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/464f9951f90c1f083417c31a6937d090ae2b6256"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:34:29Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:34:29Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"feat(panel): Firma integration Phase 1a — preisanfrage as source of truth\n\nUser asked for the Firmen + Auschreibungen to come from\npreisanfrage.kalkus.de (which already runs n8n every 5 min, scans 98\nOneDrive Bauunternehmer-Ordner, parses GAEB into Postgres). After\nresearch + 4 architecture-decision questions answered: build the\ncalculation panel as a CONSUMER of preisanfrage, not a parallel Firma\nstore.\n\nDecisions (multi_company_integration_architecture.md):\n  1. Live API on every page load + 60 s in-memory cache\n  2. Show all 98 firmas (managed + external from OneDrive), badge\n     unadopted ones \"Neu — Setup ausstehend\"\n  3. One shared service-account JWT (env PREISANFRAGE_SERVICE_JWT)\n  4. Per-Firma calc defaults live in panel-api''s own table\n     (firma_calc_defaults) — no preisanfrage schema migration needed\n\nPhase 1a shipped in this commit:\n- panel-api/src/lib/preisanfrage.ts — typed client wrapping\n  /companies, /projects, /admin/external-firmas/overview,\n  /admin/external-firmas/{id}/projects. snake_case→camelCase mapping\n  + 60 s cache + graceful 502/503 on upstream errors.\n- panel-api/src/routes/firmen.ts — GET /firmen (98-row BI list with\n  custom-defaults flag), GET /firmen/:kind/:id (Firma detail + projects),\n  PUT /firmen/:kind/:id/defaults (upsert), DELETE (reset to globals).\n  Cookie-auth gated; service-JWT scoped server-side only.\n- panel-api/src/schema.ts + db.ts — firma_calc_defaults table keyed by\n  (preisanfrage_firma_id, firma_kind). Stores Material/NU Zuschlag in\n  basis points + Verrechnungslohn/Geräte in cents for exact roundtrip.\n- src/pages/panel/Firmen.tsx — list page with search, filter\n  (Alle/Verwaltet/Extern/Zuletzt-gewonnen), trade-type badge, won-count,\n  brutto-Umsatz, last-submission date.\n- src/pages/panel/Firma.tsx — detail page with editable defaults form\n  (Material/NU %, Verrechnungslohn €/h, Geräte €/h) + reset-to-globals,\n  + Ausschreibungen-Liste with OneDrive deep links.\n- src/lib/api.ts — typed client methods api.firmen.{list, detail,\n  updateDefaults, resetDefaults, health}.\n- src/App.tsx — new /panel/firmen and /panel/firmen/:kind/:id routes.\n- src/pages/panel/PanelLayout.tsx — Firmen nav entry (Building2 icon).\n- 8 new panel-api tests (preisanfrage client + caching + error mapping\n  + migration idempotency + service-JWT leak guard). All 64 panel-api\n  tests pass; all 349 frontend vitest tests pass.\n\nDoc: docs/v2_redesign/preisanfrage_patch_instructions.md — step-by-step\npreisanfrage-side changes the user must apply (CORS + bot user + JWT\nprovisioning + env vars + deploy).\n\nPhase 1b (NOT in this commit, sketched in arch doc): wire each\nAuschreibung row to \"Kalkulation starten\" — create a kalku-website\nproject seeded from preisanfrage positions, link via preisanfrage_project_id.\n\nVerified: npx tsc clean (root + panel-api), npm run lint 0 errors,\nnpm run build 3,76 s, npm test (panel-api) 64/64, vitest run 349/349.","tree":{"sha":"74f88b7a3fdf7cac7c7211f31eea8f0af6b5d4f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/74f88b7a3fdf7cac7c7211f31eea8f0af6b5d4f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKGQ0Y2JjNWRjN2I5Mzk2ZTg3YjFlM2EyMjIyYmI2YjlhNWNkYjBmNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe","sha":"d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe"}],"sha":"d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/d4cbc5dc7b9396e87b1e3a2222bb6b9a5cdb0f5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:15:54Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:15:54Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"chore: log preisanfrage-integration research iteration","tree":{"sha":"e890bb6d5da1314ad93e7db2ad277ddb711049f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/e890bb6d5da1314ad93e7db2ad277ddb711049f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKGQzNGY3NzkwNDJkNjNjYjYyZWJjNGUwMzlmMDVjZTQwYmU1ZTA1ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c","sha":"6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c"}],"sha":"d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/d34f779042d63cb62ebc4e039f05ce40be5e05fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:15:31Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:15:31Z","email":"it@kalku.de","name":"Mani"},"message":"docs: integration architecture — preisanfrage as Firmen/Auschreibungen source\n\nUser clarified that we should consume Firmen + Auschreibungen from the\nsister system preisanfrage.kalkus.de instead of building a parallel\nFirma layer in kalku-website. Researched preisanfrage:\n\n- 98 Firmen-Ordner in OneDrive KT01 - Documents (verified)\n- Postgres companies + projects + external_companies tables (BI view)\n- FastAPI JWT-Bearer endpoints /companies, /projects, /admin/external-firmas/*\n- n8n workflow scans OneDrive every 5 min, parses GAEB into preisanfrage\n- CORS currently allows preisanfrage origin only; kalku-website NOT in list\n\nProposed split: preisanfrage owns *what we calculate for* (firm + tender +\nGAEB-parsed positions + Submissionsergebnis); kalku-website owns *the\ncalculation itself* (EP/GP/Zuschlag, share-links, customer comments).\n\n3-phase rollout sketched, with 4 decision questions for the user:\n  1. Live API vs nightly mirror\n  2. All 98 firms vs adopted-only\n  3. Per-user vs service-account JWT\n  4. Calc-default columns on preisanfrage.companies or kalku-website panel-api\n\nDoc supersedes the earlier multi_company_proposal.md (greenfield Firma\nplan) but keeps it for context. No code change in this commit.","tree":{"sha":"13a3c61c00614aaa3cb46aca221d29580ea76dd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/trees/13a3c61c00614aaa3cb46aca221d29580ea76dd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/git/commits/6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178138257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kalku-tech","id":178138257,"login":"kalku-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOCp4skQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalku-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c","node_id":"C_kwDOSddkS9oAKDZlYTY3NWIxNTM4NWZhNGFlZDUwNWM2NDM2MDBlNmJiNzlmM2YxMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commit/b3077d48ac3bdca614d0011cb7eb9b694e1c231e","sha":"b3077d48ac3bdca614d0011cb7eb9b694e1c231e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manigolchin/kalkuweb/commits/b3077d48ac3bdca614d0011cb7eb9b694e1c231e"}],"sha":"6ea675b15385fa4aed505c643600e6bb79f3f10c","url":"https://api.github.com/re