uno Silva"},"message":"feat(insights): add pt-br article on the alphanumeric cnpj\n\nCover storage, validation and migration of the new CNPJ format in\nrelational databases: column types per DBMS, collation risks, check\nconstraints, index cost, low downtime migration and Prisma specifics.\nInclude DV implementations in C#, TypeScript and PL/pgSQL.\n\nDemote previously featured pt-br articles so the new one takes the\nfeatured slot. Includes prettier re-wrapping in two touched articles.","tree":{"sha":"ac3fb277b7abd0ef9c8428ede8215fdec3ab582f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizedeals/optimizedeals/git/trees/ac3fb277b7abd0ef9c8428ede8215fdec3ab582f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizedeals/optimizedeals/git/commits/71f8685800f7d4bb7a45958df7c515a9c8bf5d14","verification":{"payload":"tree ac3fb277b7abd0ef9c8428ede8215fdec3ab582f\nparent 6d73d95fbb5b71929949a5e91f9c488aca050fe6\nauthor Bruno Silva <bruno3dcontato@gmail.com> 1785555377 -0300\ncommitter Bruno Silva <bruno3dcontato@gmail.com> 1785555377 -0300\n\nfeat(insights): add pt-br article on the alphanumeric cnpj\n\nCover storage, validation and migration of the new CNPJ format in\nrelational databases: column types per DBMS, collation risks, check\nconstraints, index cost, low downtime migration and Prisma specifics.\nInclude DV implementations in C#, TypeScript and PL/pgSQL.\n\nDemote previously featured pt-br articles so the new one takes the\nfeatured slot. Includes prettier re-wrapping in two touched articles.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEyrfCo0UsI81uycTWPfvEI+XXr/UFAmptabEACgkQPfvEI+XX\nr/XV8Q//c5Om84Y9SeXydeTgEHCWZf+HKHMQWAoUA+6csPWLM6K+7pHpy4qULg4d\nczU6+kkVCFfgUfNTYpM8c48G9pp+zgBbyv8NZjxcVDMw+oxQaXs3tR90xofnahWD\niq8PJWv7cNPSVDmWwthb9e7IueJjGMaE+m1hsPWg3u+oHJL54DeY0sFLqZu90yRj\nrnixCUxytcSDxnXgS5AM+ODY0YcYHe9YElczJ4nvmPxnI4NDEmEHA4xcGBVzLXTd\noouCecngaBDb0V+3oPaOtgTk1JZODy4uekDmPGRLsMaMh/0gTZjBi83F99rc5mxS\nDWyzNKBt/HqxRFDbTvc+TBslmE5O