rs/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/76bfcae9ed607386f0c241114c8e7280b25e1255/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:11:35Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:11:35Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"message":"fix(hooks): decide self-approval on resulting Status, anchor Arquivos field\n\nRound 1 review fixes for spec-gate.mjs:\n- Rule 1 now computes the resulting text of the edit (Edit/MultiEdit/Write)\n  and compares Status before vs after, so leaving review to any value\n  (approved, Approved, done, missing line) triggers ask, and checkbox edits\n  on an already-approved spec do not. Falls back to the literal\n  ''**Status:** approved'' check only when the result can''t be computed.\n- Rule 2''s Arquivos: collection now anchors to a field line (start of line,\n  optional bullet/bold marker) so template prose mentioning the word\n  Arquivos: no longer disables the \"nothing declared -> block all\" fallback.\n- Amended meta/specs/2026-09-27-harness-endurecimento-design.md section 3\n  items 1-2 to match the ruling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99e4657e0a2175b50cb2c8804dec1b22799c4904","url":"https://api.github.com/re