per-project backlogs in monorepo\n\nSingle-project scaffold couldn''t model a product with multiple\nprojects (web/api/bff): a feature touching several projects had\nnowhere unambiguous to live, and root product-backlog.md mixed\nevery project''s tasks in one growing table.\n\n- /backlog and /groom resolve $SCOPE like /spec already does\n- single-project tasks go to docs/$SCOPE/context/backlog.md,\n  IDs prefixed by project (API-TASK01, WEB-TASK01)\n- cross-project tasks stay in root product-backlog.md with a\n  new \"Projetos\" column, fan out to per-project waves at /spec time\n- spec.md, back.md, front.md, hands-on.md, recheck.md, backend.md,\n  frontend.md updated to resolve the correct backlog file by ID\n  prefix instead of assuming root","tree":{"sha":"0da3a7d8757144380c6d6dffaf1c5c62343b8588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/0da3a7d8757144380c6d6dffaf1c5c62343b8588"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/431344a73015f0cb351aac75bb73cfd7f99ca18d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptio