mail":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T21:58:28Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"message":"docs(monorepo): move scoped docs under docs/$SCOPE instead of app dirs\n\nDocs generated for a specific app/package lived inside the app''s own\nfolder (apps/api/docs/) and used a loose docs/apps/<name>.md index.\nMixed code and documentation trees, and split the doc index from the\nscoped content it described.\n\nMove all scoped output to docs/$SCOPE/ (e.g. docs/apps/api/), fully\nunder the root docs/ tree, with docs/$SCOPE/README.md as the index.\nUpdate every command and agent that reads/writes scoped docs (spec,\nback, front, checkpoint, review, retomar, recheck, hands-on,\nbackend/frontend/planner/reviewer agents), fix the real path\nresolution in the spec-gate hook (not just its comments), and update\nthe retroactive-documentation and upgrade-harness prompts to detect\nand migrate the old layout.","tree":{"sha":"097802cd1cd6c4d9a4c6dfd04fc527ae7d4ea566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/097802cd1cd6c4d9a4c6dfd04fc527ae7d4ea566"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/1bea649f59c3d2b476a080eafb0537fb8ba5a2f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","r