nformato padrão, hooks, workflows, templates, prompts). docs/ passa a conter\napenas conteúdo de produto. Remove AGENTS.md e todo suporte multi-ferramenta\n(Cursor/Copilot/Codex) — scaffold agora é Claude Code apenas.","tree":{"sha":"c4b96a4db64262b0a78fd98ad9eeb6c07bdebe32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/c4b96a4db64262b0a78fd98ad9eeb6c07bdebe32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/d06b59aca1a08e109e490b5eb65b3804c23a0713","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/d06b59aca1a08e109e490b5eb65b3804c23a0713","node_id":"C_kwDOSdozz9oAKGQwNmI1OWFjYTFhMDhlMTA5ZTQ5MGI1ZWI2NWIzODA0YzIzYTA3MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","sha":"14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e","sha":"24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e"}],"sha":"d06b59aca1a08e109e490b5eb65b3804c23a0713","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/d06b59aca1a08e109e490b5eb65b3804c23a0713"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:15:14Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:15:14Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"message":"refactor: consolida harness em .claude/, docs/ vira produto-only, remove multi-tool\n\nO scaffold tinha duas camadas paralelas (docs/ \"agnóstico de ferramenta\" +\n.claude/ como wrapper fino) para suportar Cursor/Copilot/Codex além do Claude\nCode. Na prática só o Claude Code era usado, e a duplicação custava drift\nconstante entre os dois lados de cada comando.\n\nMovido para .claude/ (harness — como os agentes operam):\n- docs/skills/*.md -> .claude/skills/<nome>/SKILL.md, formato padrão do\n  Claude Code (frontmatter name+description). O harness já reconhece as 5\n  como skills invocáveis pela ferramenta Skill.\n- docs/commands/*.md consolidado direto em .claude/commands/*.md — sem mais\n  indireção \"@docs/commands/X.md\"; cada comando é a fonte única.\n- docs/workflows/*.md -> .claude/workflows/\n- docs/prompts/*.md -> .claude/prompts/\n- docs/specs/spec-template.md -> .claude/templates/spec-template.md\n- docs/comparativo-scaffold-vs-superpowers.md -> .claude/\n- docs/commands/README.md -> .claude/README.md (referência do harness;\n  renomeado para não ser lido como slash command por estar fora de commands/)\n\nMantido em docs/ (produto — o que ele é):\n- context/, architecture/, specs/ (specs ativas), archive/, features/,\n  changelog/ — regras de negócio, decisões, especificações da feature em si.\n\nSubagentes e comandos que compartilhavam papel (ex: /back e o subagente\nbackend) agora convergem na mesma skill em vez de duplicar o conteúdo em dois\narquivos — Skill adicionada às tools dos 4 agentes, comandos e agentes trocam\n\"leia o arquivo X\" por \"invoque a skill X\".\n\nRemove AGENTS.md (adaptador Cursor/Copilot/Codex) e toda referência a ele.\nREADME.md reescrito: remove tagline \"compatível com Cursor, Codex, Copilot\",\ntabela de adaptadores, instruções de cp para múltiplas ferramentas; passa a\ndescrever só o fluxo Claude Code.\n\nVerificado: 5 skills com YAML válido, 11 commands e 4 agents com frontmatter\nválido, hooks e settings.example.json intactos, zero link markdown quebrado,\nzero referência residual às pastas antigas fora do changelog histórico\n(que documenta o estado da época e não deve ser reescrito).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4b96a4db64262b0a78fd98ad9eeb6c07bdebe32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/c4b96a4db64262b0a78fd98ad9eeb6c07bdebe32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e","node_id":"C_kwDOSdozz9oAKDI0Mzg4YjNjOGI2MWU0Mzg1MmM0MDI3OWFiYzc1NjY0YzI2YjUwOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","sha":"14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce"}],"sha":"24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/24388b3c8b61e43852c40279abc75664c26b508e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:01:36Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:01:36Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/harness-guardrails-agents''\n\nGuardrails de inicialização, verificação executável (hooks), subagentes por\npapel com isolamento de contexto, gate de Spec mecânico e rastreabilidade\nFR->tarefa->teste.","tree":{"sha":"d1068135060302532bedfcc3de735df0d0d2ba4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/d1068135060302532bedfcc3de735df0d0d2ba4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","node_id":"C_kwDOSdozz9oAKDE0MjM5NDQxZjRlNTY0ZWVjZjI5NTZlZmMwZWE0MzYzZDU4NjA0Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/70475fe539573b3bbf2f42057834414a343d579c","sha":"70475fe539573b3bbf2f42057834414a343d579c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/70475fe539573b3bbf2f42057834414a343d579c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874","sha":"1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874"}],"sha":"14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/14239441f4e564eecf2956efc0ea4363d58604ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:59:35Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:59:35Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"message":"feat(harness): gate de Spec mecânico, rastreabilidade FR e constituição\n\nFecha o resto do diagnóstico: gate de aprovação virava honra, critério de\naceite não linkava a requisito nenhum, e não havia lugar para princípios\narquiteturais não-negociáveis.\n\nConstituição:\n- docs/context/constitution.md — princípios CN-XXX (direção de dependência,\n  testes junto da implementação, acoplamento). Diferente de guardrails (o que\n  é proibido fazer), define como o sistema deve ser construído.\n- Gerada por /init-project (Bloco 7, obrigatório) e pelo bootstrap retroativo\n  (Passo 5.6, inferida da estrutura real do código).\n- Carregada por todos os papéis e pelos 4 subagentes; violação é BLOCKER no\n  reviewer mesmo com testes verdes.\n\nGate de Spec mecânico:\n- .claude/hooks/spec-gate.mjs (PreToolUse) bloqueia Edit/Write/MultiEdit em\n  código enquanto a Spec ativa (**Spec ativo:** em current-state.md) estiver\n  Status: review. Falha em aberto sem current-state.md, sem Spec ativa\n  declarada, ou sem a Spec existir no disco. Testado em 7 cenários.\n- Limite documentado: não impede o agente de editar o próprio campo Status —\n  isso continua sendo instrução, não algo que um hook consiga distinguir de\n  aprovação humana.\n- /spec e o agente planner passam a atualizar Spec ativo ao gerar o\n  artefato, em vez de esperar o /checkpoint de fim de sessão — sem isso o\n  hook fica cego para a Spec recém-criada no fluxo comum (spec → aprovar →\n  implementar na mesma sessão).\n\nRastreabilidade FR -> tarefa -> teste:\n- spec-template.md ganha seção 7 (Rastreabilidade): tabela FR / Coberto por /\n  Verificado por. Todo FR sem tarefa é requisito esquecido; toda tarefa sem FR\n  é escopo não declarado.\n- Campo Cobre: nas tarefas, ao lado de Depende de / Paralelizável com /\n  Arquivos.\n- planner.md e o agente planner recusam gerar a Spec se ela exigir violar um\n  GR-XXX ou CN-XXX — escalam ao humano em vez de planejar a exceção.\n- quality.md e o agente reviewer ganham gate de rastreabilidade: critério [x]\n  sem FR correspondente é sinalizado.\n\nTambém: guardrails.md e constitution.md adicionados à leitura obrigatória de\n/back, /front, /review, /spec (doc e agente) — estavam carregando verification\nmas não guardrails/constitution em alguns comandos; corrigida uma duplicação\nde linha introduzida na sessão anterior em back.md e um bug de numeração de\npassos no agente planner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1068135060302532bedfcc3de735df0d0d2ba4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/d1068135060302532bedfcc3de735df0d0d2ba4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874","node_id":"C_kwDOSdozz9oAKDE4MTBjNDkwODEyZGE4ZjNlY2M0M2IxNWQ4OWEzMTI5OTQ5NzE4NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/696f983d578029e371827aa1f1cd89e4f82371f5","sha":"696f983d578029e371827aa1f1cd89e4f82371f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/696f983d578029e371827aa1f1cd89e4f82371f5"}],"sha":"1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/1810c490812da8f3ecc43b15d89a312994971874"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/696f983d578029e371827aa1f1cd89e4f82371f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T00:45:21Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T00:45:21Z","email":"roberto.urias@gmail.com","name":"Roberto Nicoletti"},"message":"feat(harness): guardrails, verificação executável e subagentes por papel\n\nO scaffold funcionava como documentação, mas não como harness: o loop de\nexecução não tinha verificador, o gate de aprovação era honra, e nenhuma\nfeature de agente do Claude Code estava em uso.\n\nGuardrails (novo requisito de inicialização):\n- docs/context/guardrails.md — limites invioláveis, comandos de verificação,\n  caminhos protegidos, regras GR-XXX. Carregado por todos os papéis; vence\n  qualquer outra instrução em caso de conflito.\n- settings.example.json ganha deny (45 regras: .env, chaves, push --force,\n  reset --hard, reset de banco, publish) e defaultMode válido — \"auto\" não é\n  aceito pelo Claude Code.\n- Gerados por /init-project (Bloco 6) e pelo bootstrap retroativo (Passo 5.5),\n  ambos inferindo do repositório real antes de perguntar.\n\nVerificação executável:\n- .claude/hooks/verify-file.mjs (PostToolUse) — ESLint no arquivo editado.\n- .claude/hooks/verify-project.mjs (Stop) — type-check se .ts/.tsx mudou.\n  Ambos falham em aberto; exit 2 + stderr devolve o erro ao agente.\n- docs/skills/verification.md — fonte canônica do que significa \"pronto\".\n  Nenhum critério de aceite vira [x] sem saída real de comando.\n- /back, /front, /hands-on, /review e quality.md passam a exigir evidência.\n\nSubagentes:\n- .claude/agents/{backend,frontend,reviewer,planner}.md com contexto isolado.\n  reviewer sem Edit/Write — independência do parecer por construção, não por\n  promessa no prompt.\n- /hands-on despacha os subagentes por tarefa em vez de injetar o papel inline.\n- Campo Arquivos: nas tarefas da Spec + validação de colisão antes de\n  paralelizar; ondas paralelas compartilham a working tree e se sobrescrevem\n  em silêncio. Flags --worktree e --serial como escape hatch.\n\nComandos:\n- Frontmatter nos 11 wrappers (description, argument-hint, allowed-tools,\n  model). allowed-tools torna /review e /retomar somente-leitura por\n  construção. @docs/commands/X.md elimina um tool call por invocação.\n- /commit criado (wrapper existia apontando para doc inexistente).\n- /groom ganha wrapper (comando documentado mas inacessível).\n\nCorreções de referência:\n- docs/agents/*.agent.md (3 refs) -> docs/skills/\n- comando /architecture inexistente removido de 2 arquivos\n- docs/archive/, docs/context/domains/, docs/features/ e product-backlog.md\n  criados — eram citados em 6 arquivos e não existiam\n\nRemove docs/skills/supabase.md e todas as referências: o scaffold é agnóstico\nde plataforma e o arquivo carregava por padrão no papel BACKEND.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ac49726ea5f71713c457321f46307e80c5d3711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/trees/8ac49726ea5f71713c457321f46307e80c5d3711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/git/commits/696f983d578029e371827aa1f1cd89e4f82371f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2049373?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias","id":2049373,"login":"robertourias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDkzNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertourias","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/696f983d578029e371827aa1f1cd89e4f82371f5","node_id":"C_kwDOSdozz9oAKDY5NmY5ODNkNTc4MDI5ZTM3MTgyN2FhMWYxY2Q4OWU0ZjgyMzcxZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commit/70475fe539573b3bbf2f42057834414a343d579c","sha":"70475fe539573b3bbf2f42057834414a343d579c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robertourias/scaffold-ia-projetos/commits/70475fe539573b3bbf2f42057834414a343d579c"}