islavbudinsky@gmail.com","name":"Rastislav Budinsky"},"message":"Initial public release\n\nForked from vitali87/code-graph-rag at upstream commit\n7f3b092b7ff418bfd92d545c834dd93708958630 (2025-11-03). Commit history\nhas been squashed; the LICENSE file retains the MIT copyright of the\noriginal author alongside the fork modifications.\n\nAdditions made in this fork (see thesis Chapter 5, Knowledge Base\nsection, for detail):\n  - Kotlin language support via Tree-sitter, including nullable-type\n    and generic-type handling\n  - Method return-type and parameter-type extraction in the graph\n    schema (previously only names and signatures were stored)\n  - REST API layer over the indexer and query engine, replacing the\n    original CLI-only interface\n  - Additional retrieval tooling: semantic-search-first prompting,\n    grep tool, query-context window, retry mechanism\n\nAt the time of writing, the upstream repository and its author''s\nGitHub account are publicly unreachable (HTTP 404).","tree":{"sha":"32ea3b44dcb0c75a53ffaf03a3101ffb4a739c6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/The-Huginn/rixo-code-graph-rag/git/trees/32ea3b44dcb0c75a53ffaf03a3101ffb4a739c6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/The-Huginn/rixo-code-graph-rag/git/commits/28f4e78ab53853ef6bd56fcb932119469ec5e65e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78657734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Huginn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Huginn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Huginn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Huginn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/The-Huginn","id":78657734,"login":"The-Huginn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjU3NzM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Huginn/orgs","received_events_url"