\n  remotes; modulePreload:false and cssCodeSplit:false to keep the\n  remoteEntry self-contained\n- src/Routes.tsx: a pathless layout route wrapping Kanban with an\n  `index` child (renders null in the Outlet) and a `new` child\n  (NewIssue) — the index child is required so the layout matches at\n  /board and Kanban actually renders\n- src/pages: Kanban and NewIssue; components/IssueCard.tsx\n- src/main.tsx: standalone bootstrap via HostStandaloneProvider\n- shell-host.d.ts: shim for the `shell/host` specifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bcbd46e1e1316af88894cf9c23aa1129ed59f46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/git/trees/6bcbd46e1e1316af88894cf9c23aa1129ed59f46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/git/commits/93928641ee4c4e90099cf19ce744531f523e8ec0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54994420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MaxwellOlliver","id":54994420,"login":"MaxwellOlliver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTk0NDIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver","user_view_typ