:"2026-05-15T22:45:17Z","email":"maxwellmacedo2015@gmail.com","name":"Maxwell Macedo"},"message":"feat(inbox): add the inbox remote\n\nThe inbox remote (port 5001) owns the /inbox/* route subtree — a thread\nlist and thread view.\n\n- vite.config.ts: federation() exposing ./Routes -> ./src/Routes.tsx,\n  consuming shell for the host module; react/react-dom/react-router-dom\n  singletons; dts:false; chrome89 target\n- src/Routes.tsx: the federated entry — a <Routes> tree with relative\n  paths so the remote is agnostic to the prefix the shell mounts it under\n- src/main.tsx: standalone bootstrap — wraps in HostStandaloneProvider\n  from @repo/host-contract/standalone so `pnpm --filter inbox dev` runs\n  without a shell\n- src/pages: ThreadList and ThreadView; src/data.ts: demo thread data\n- shell-host.d.ts: shim for the `shell/host` federated specifier\n- standalone.css: styles for solo dev only\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"900ac6520f127076cdab5d89cfdd24f22259b382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/git/trees/900ac6520f127076cdab5d89cfdd24f22259b382"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/git/commits/1729b487385d449e25226174104462575e730a8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54994420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MaxwellOlliver","id":54994420,"login":"MaxwellOlliver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTk0NDIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver/orgs","received_events_u