tions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellOlliver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/commits/09fb0670aef68634779b5fa01a0e18de06970124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:45:09Z","email":"maxwellmacedo2015@gmail.com","name":"Maxwell Macedo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:45:09Z","email":"maxwellmacedo2015@gmail.com","name":"Maxwell Macedo"},"message":"feat(shell): add the host application\n\nThe shell (port 5000) is both host and remote: it consumes the three\nremotes and exposes `./host` back to them.\n\n- vite.config.ts: federation() consuming inbox/board/issue and exposing\n  ./host -> ./src/host/index.ts; react, react-dom and react-router-dom\n  declared singleton; dts:false (hand-written shims instead); build\n  target chrome89 for the federation runtime''s top-level await\n- src/host: AuthProvider + WorkspaceProvider implement the\n  @repo/host-contract HostModule; nav.ts provides useShellNavigate;\n  index.ts is the exposed federated entry\n- src/layout: AppLayout, Sidebar, Topbar, RemoteFallback (error/loading\n  boundary for remotes that fail to load)\n- src/App.tsx: single <BrowserRouter> with wildcard routes\n  (inbox/* board/* issue/*) handing off to each remote''s ./Routes\n- src/index.css: the only Tailwind v4 entry point; @source pulls in\n  remote and package sources so their classes get compiled here\n- src/remotes.d.ts: hand-written `declare module` shims for the\n  federated remote specifiers so typecheck works on a cold clone\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3061acd20913259c51794c37f3ca882d1f53bfe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/git/trees/3061acd20913259c51794c37f3ca882d1f53bfe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MaxwellOlliver/module-federation-vite/git/commits/09fb0670aef68634779b5fa01a0e18de06970124","verification":{"paylo