huzsyam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alhuzsyam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alhuzsyam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alhuzsyam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alhuzsyam/simkopai/commits/2b49ed68250e21bb23f558c083fb988f09469d8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T17:23:52Z","email":"alhuzwirialfi@gmail.com","name":"Alhuzsyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T17:23:52Z","email":"alhuzwirialfi@gmail.com","name":"Alhuzsyam"},"message":"feat(inventory): produk olahan (BOM) + produksi batch\n\n- Model: Product.is_made + yield_qty, tabel product_components (BOM)\n- POST /products/{id}/produce: potong komponen, tambah stok olahan,\n  update cost_price via moving average; blokir kalau stok komponen kurang\n- create/update product: sync komponen + guard siklus BOM & self-ref\n- get_product: balikan komponen (nama+unit) untuk editor/preview\n- delete guard diperluas: cek pemakaian sbg komponen olahan, bukan menu saja\n- Frontend Inventori: toggle olahan + editor komponen, badge 🧪,\n  tombol & modal Produksi dengan preview bahan yang dipotong\n\nJualan tetap single-level (potong stok olahan langsung, tanpa rekursi).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2aa99bd67bb4d1db89d76693a542561fce9e5413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alhuzsyam/simkopai/git/trees/2aa99bd67bb4d1db89d76693a542561fce9e5413"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alhuzsyam/simkopai/git/commits/2b49ed68250e21bb23f558c083fb988f09469d8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64511435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alhuzsyam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alhuzsyam/followers","following_url":"https://ap