/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shyu-x/SimpleAgent/commits/9e129510ad328ee0184788311e1aab55fda915ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T01:13:16Z","email":"shyu15551@gmail.com","name":"Shyu-x"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T01:13:16Z","email":"shyu15551@gmail.com","name":"Shyu-x"},"message":"feat(admin-cache): 完善缓存策略\n\n功能:\n- 缓存命中率监控 (hitRate, windowHitRate 滑动窗口)\n- 缓存大小限制 (LRU 淘汰策略, maxSize 配置)\n- 手动缓存失效接口 (按 name/key/pattern 删除)\n- 批量缓存操作 (mset/mget/mdel)\n\n专用缓存实例:\n- modelConfigCache: 模型配置 (TTL 1h)\n- toolRegistryCache: 工具注册表 (TTL 1h)\n- ragResultCache: RAG 检索结果 (TTL 5min)\n- promptTemplateCache: Prompt 模板 (TTL 30min)\n\nAPI 端点:\n- GET /api/admin/cache/stats - 所有缓存统计\n- GET /api/admin/cache/:name/stats - 指定缓存统计\n- DELETE /api/admin/cache/:name - 清空指定缓存\n- DELETE /api/admin/cache/:name/:key - 删除指定键\n- DELETE /api/admin/cache/:name/pattern/:pattern - 模式删除\n- POST /api/admin/cache/invalidate/* - 缓存失效接口","tree":{"sha":"b84c2b33d491eee93958b57c32caa9fc403cf628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shyu-x/SimpleAgent/git/trees/b84c2b33d491eee93958b57c32caa9fc403cf628"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shyu-x/SimpleAgent/git/commits/9e129510ad328ee0184788311e1aab55fda915ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185513199?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shyu-x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/use