url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/ee4d9de77d096f4a3b1da7e36763c0d8db4525ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T20:01:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T20:01:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add /admin first-run setup wizard\n\nSidesteps the wrangler d1 execute --remote --file dance (which hits\nAuthentication code:10000 on the /import endpoint with OAuth tokens, and\nneeds --shell:true gymnastics on Windows just to spawn npx.cmd).\n\nNew GET /api/auth/setup reports whether any users exist. POST /api/auth/setup\ncreates the first admin and signs them in via session cookie, but only while\nthe users table is empty — every call after that returns 403. AdminApp checks\nthe status on load and shows a setup form when needed; once a user exists\nthe page falls back to the standard login.\n\nOperator flow becomes: deploy, hit /admin, fill in email/name/password, you''re\nin. The create-staff CLI script is still there for adding more accounts later.","tree":{"sha":"5e5a7a2a0c08e3d6a87db15ad683e7bcce2af9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/trees/5e5a7a2a0c08e3d6a87db15ad683e7bcce2af9c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/commits/ee4d9de77d096f4a3b1da7e36763c0d8db4525ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e5a7a2a0c08e3d6a87db15ad683e7bcce2af9c8\nparent 5350d6a0df5d73db90b762ff017cf9aca747fefc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778875294 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778875294 +0000\n\nAdd /admin first-run setup wizard\n\nSidesteps the wrangler d1 execute --remote --file dance (which hits\nAuthentication code:10000 on the /import endpoint with OAuth tokens, and\nneeds --shell:true gymnastics on Windows just to spawn npx.cmd).\n\nNew GET /api/auth/setup reports whether any users exist. POST /api/auth/setup\ncreates the first admin and signs them in via session cookie, but only while\nthe users table is empty — every call after that returns 403. AdminApp checks\nthe status on load and shows a setup form when needed; once a user exists\nthe page falls back to the standard login.\n\nOperator flow becomes: deploy, hit /admin, fill in email/name/password, you''re\nin. The create-staff CLI script is still there for adding more accounts later.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO+ibjFB\nuj+1McE10J4BLcWZlTbjflzKonAUexnfvdd+r54ZeQD92Hv4feBQG9h9YK2M0dYineyNs8c8zYNB\nFQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T20:01:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/ee4d9de77d096f4a3b1da7e36763c0d8db4525ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSeZ7_9oAKGVlNGQ5ZGU3N2QwOTZmNGEzYjFkYTdlMzY3NjNjMGQ4ZGI0NTI1YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/5350d6a0df5d73db90b762ff017cf9aca747fefc","sha":"5350d6a0df5d73db90b762ff017cf9aca747fefc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/5350d6a0df5d73db90b762ff017cf9aca747fefc"}],"sha":"ee4d9de77d096f4a3b1da7e36763c0d8db4525ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/ee4d9de77d096f4a3b1da7e36763c0d8db4525ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/5350d6a0df5d73db90b762ff017cf9aca747fefc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:56:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:56:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"create-staff: restore shell:true on Windows for .cmd spawn\n\nNode 20.12.2+ rejects `spawn(''npx.cmd'', ...)` without shell:true (CVE-2024-27980).\nRe-add it on Windows; the only arg passing through cmd.exe now is a plain temp\nfile path with no shell metacharacters, so the previous mangling problem doesn''t\nrecur.","tree":{"sha":"6461b6c062fabb31e0dde6a6bb9fd089e19b9120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/trees/6461b6c062fabb31e0dde6a6bb9fd089e19b9120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/commits/5350d6a0df5d73db90b762ff017cf9aca747fefc","verification":{"payload":"tree 6461b6c062fabb31e0dde6a6bb9fd089e19b9120\nparent a88cc9ee15d193039f976bd9e4b4b2d428c9a899\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874966 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874966 +0000\n\ncreate-staff: restore shell:true on Windows for .cmd spawn\n\nNode 20.12.2+ rejects `spawn(''npx.cmd'', ...)` without shell:true (CVE-2024-27980).\nRe-add it on Windows; the only arg passing through cmd.exe now is a plain temp\nfile path with no shell metacharacters, so the previous mangling problem doesn''t\nrecur.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEC/ZtPB\nKJ1v1DwQ7h26ePKeMDd9Y36axZAdvpRpCCTJsW1+/LrbPjW5TG7R5wD72J1m9loI+wVGVz+V0JOh\nsAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T19:56:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3",