b.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/a88cc9ee15d193039f976bd9e4b4b2d428c9a899/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:54:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:54:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"create-staff: pass SQL to wrangler via temp file, not --command\n\nWindows cmd.exe re-tokenizes long quoted arguments on whitespace and commas,\nwhich shreds our INSERT...ON CONFLICT statement when wrangler reads argv.\nWrite the SQL to a temp file and pass --file instead. Clean up the temp file\nin a finally block. Spawn npx.cmd directly without shell on Windows so the\nfile path arg also gets through intact.","tree":{"sha":"dcd28ebb74dc8737e183ea04e1f2026919ae95a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/trees/dcd28ebb74dc8737e183ea04e1f2026919ae95a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/commits/a88cc9ee15d193039f976bd9e4b4b2d428c9a899","verification":{"payload":"tree dcd28ebb74dc8737e183ea04e1f2026919ae95a5\nparent 7e5931fa56cf091128d8d2fbce6483c5e3133802\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874879 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874879 +0000\n\ncreate-staff: pass SQL to wrangler via temp file, not --command\n\nWindows cmd.exe re-tokenizes long quoted arguments on whitespace and commas,\nwhich shreds our INSERT...ON CONFLICT statement when wrangler reads argv.\nWrite the SQL to a temp file and pass --file instead. Clean up the temp file\nin a finally block. Spawn npx.cmd directly without shell on Windows so the\nfile path arg also gets through intact.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOyoXTbt\n4puK8EKV08A2bxjfz8eRDGkBcwzGI0qH3He9h4uQvXj2pMu88vOzeLXnSQzzbwmoceyIMYGOq6Bi\naQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verifie