ude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/7e5931fa56cf091128d8d2fbce6483c5e3133802/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:51:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:51:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"create-staff: resolve npx correctly on Windows\n\nNode''s child_process.spawn doesn''t auto-append `.cmd` to executable names, so\nspawn(''npx'', ...) blows up with ENOENT on Windows. Use ''npx.cmd'' there and run\nthrough the shell so the .cmd shim is honored. Surface ''error'' events too so\nPATH issues report cleanly instead of crashing as an unhandled emitter.","tree":{"sha":"d42196972feccdc7d0fa8b0ba296d7f1612e8881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/trees/d42196972feccdc7d0fa8b0ba296d7f1612e8881"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/commits/7e5931fa56cf091128d8d2fbce6483c5e3133802","verification":{"payload":"tree d42196972feccdc7d0fa8b0ba296d7f1612e8881\nparent 0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874706 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874706 +0000\n\ncreate-staff: resolve npx correctly on Windows\n\nNode''s child_process.spawn doesn''t auto-append `.cmd` to executable names, so\nspawn(''npx'', ...) blows up with ENOENT on Windows. Use ''npx.cmd'' there and run\nthrough the shell so the .cmd shim is honored. Surface ''error'' events too so\nPATH issues report cleanly instead of crashing as an unhandled emitter.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAos1h87\n9j9pPUF46i3M83hBF5kDtlZKyO3h4ZKYOpdugOlgofhbDAYGuS3FQacYDl/5NyD7CKCjCST6Kpc1\nmQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T19:51:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/7e5931fa56cf091128d8d2fbce6483c5e3133802","node_id":"C_kwDOSeZ7_9oAKDdlNTkzMWZhNTZjZjA5MTEyOGQ4ZDJmYmNlNjQ4M2M1ZTMxMzM4MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28","sha":"0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28"}],"sha":"7e5931fa56cf091128d8d2fbce6483c5e3133802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/7e5931fa56cf091128d8d2fbce6483c5e3133802"},{"author":{