89c1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874473 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778874473 +0000\n\ncreate-staff: prompt interactively when flags are omitted\n\nRun the script with no flags and it walks through email, name, role, target\n(local/remote), and a hidden password prompt — so it works even when npm eats\nthe --email/--name flags because the user forgot the `--` separator.\n\nFlags still work when passed explicitly; --help now prints the gotcha.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEnKk6F1\nTXfC1XnKgybosIIvUF6RWY5Oi463pCiKHFZCyS0nIQbdVbtTTaEDAt4TjqrsPGHUKmc9hvEEmtPD\nGA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T19:47:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28","node_id":"C_kwDOSeZ7_9oAKDA3OTUyMjRjNzIwZGQ2MDQyYWNiY2EzZmJlODc5NDZkYTE1N2RiMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1","sha":"7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1"}],"sha":"0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/0795224c720dd6042acbca3fbe87946da157db28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:13:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:15:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add inventory sync from POS CSV + humidor portal\n\nCron-friendly inventory pipeline backed by a new cigars table with a hard\nsplit between POS-owned columns (qty, price, cost — overwritten on every\nimport) and staff-owned columns (display_name, strength, tasting_notes,\nshow_on_site — never touched by the import).\n\nBackend\n- migrations/0002_inventory.sql adds the cigars and inventory_imports tables.\n- functions/api/inventory/import.js: bearer-auth''d CSV upload. Parses headers\n  against a column mapping (default targets Square; override via\n  INVENTORY_CSV_MAPPING env var), upserts by pos_id in batches, zeroes out any\n  SKU not present in the snapshot. Records a row in inventory_imports with\n  counts + status for the history view.\n- functions/api/humidor.js: public endpoint returning curated cigars + totals.\n- functions/api/admin/cigars/{index,[id]}.js: list/search with filters,\n  staff-field-only updates so the next cron run can''t clobber curation.\n- functions/api/admin/inventory/imports.js: last 50 sync runs.\n\nFrontend\n- Public Humidor section now fetches from /api/humidor; falls back to graceful\n  empty state until staff curate cigars.\n- New admin pages: Humidor list (with All/Shown/Hidden/Needs review/Removed\n  filters + search), per-cigar editor (POS data read-only sidebar, staff\n  fields editable), and POS sync history.\n- Sidebar gets Humidor + POS sync links.\n\nValidated end to end against the user''s real Square export: 169 SKUs / 3,733\ncigars in stock imported cleanly, location-specific qty column auto-detected.\n\nREADME documents the cron snippet, deploy walkthrough, and how to override the\ncolumn mapping when the POS changes.","tree":{"sha":"69cea56ddfed1dfb8f078ece403b55023bf3dd2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/trees/69cea56ddfed1dfb8f078ece403b55023bf3dd2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/commits/7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 69cea56ddfed1dfb8f078ece403b55023bf3dd2a\nparent b86ba1cc3f36e7f2c5b1ba1e75564765cd0f3bc4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778872411 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778872517 +0000\n\nAdd inventory sync from POS CSV + humidor portal\n\nCron-friendly inventory pipeline backed by a new cigars table with a hard\nsplit between POS-owned columns (qty, price, cost — overwritten on every\nimport) and staff-owned columns (display_name, strength, tasting_notes,\nshow_on_site — never touched by the import).\n\nBackend\n- migrations/0002_inventory.sql adds the cigars and inventory_imports tables.\n- functions/api/inventory/import.js: bearer-auth''d CSV upload. Parses headers\n  against a column mapping (default targets Square; override via\n  INVENTORY_CSV_MAPPING env var), upserts by pos_id in batches, zeroes out any\n  SKU not present in the snapshot. Records a row in inventory_imports with\n  counts + status for the history view.\n- functions/api/humidor.js: public endpoint returning curated cigars + totals.\n- functions/api/admin/cigars/{index,[id]}.js: list/search with filters,\n  staff-field-only updates so the next cron run can''t clobber curation.\n- functions/api/admin/inventory/imports.js: last 50 sync runs.\n\nFrontend\n- Public Humidor section now fetches from /api/humidor; falls back to graceful\n  empty state until staff curate cigars.\n- New admin pages: Humidor list (with All/Shown/Hidden/Needs review/Removed\n  filters + search), per-cigar editor (POS data read-only sidebar, staff\n  fields editable), and POS sync history.\n- Sidebar gets Humidor + POS sync links.\n\nValidated end to end against the user''s real Square export: 169 SKUs / 3,733\ncigars in stock imported cleanly, location-specific qty column auto-detected.\n\nREADME documents the cron snippet, deploy walkthrough, and how to override the\ncolumn mapping when the POS changes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPm70Gim\nlg4XCnea0l+vks0abDSh2Zkr+0xiRvArNpHGCYx+OunibJ82OzlwyND9JGPV+4+rMgzBQh31GCgk\nyAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T19:15:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSeZ7_9oAKDdkOTkyZDk5MzI3MTRiNWQ4Y2Q0YjcwYjhiM2ZkMDU1M2I5Njg5YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jking323/jimmys-main/commit/b86ba1cc3f36e7f2c5b1ba1e75564765cd0f3bc4","sha":"b86ba1cc3f36e7f2c5b1ba1e75564765cd0f3bc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/b86ba1cc3f36e7f2c5b1ba1e75564765cd0f3bc4"}],"sha":"7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/7d992d9932714b5d8cd4b70b8b3fd0553b9689c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/commits/b86ba1cc3f36e7f2c5b1ba1e75564765cd0f3bc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T14:14:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:15:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Scaffold backend + management portal\n\nStack: Vite + React frontend, Cloudflare Pages Functions, D1 (SQLite).\n\nFrontend\n- Migrate the existing Babel-standalone components into ES modules under src/.\n- Single SPA with React Router; /admin/* is the staff portal.\n- Public Events, Cigar of the Month, RSVPs and newsletter signup now hit the API.\n\nBackend (functions/api)\n- Public endpoints: events list/detail, RSVP, current cigar of the month, newsletter subscribe.\n- Admin endpoints (gated by _middleware.js): events CRUD, RSVP list + CSV, COTM CRUD + set-current, subscriber list + unsubscribe + CSV.\n- Auth: email + password with PBKDF2-SHA256 hashing and httpOnly session cookies stored in D1.\n\nPortal (src/admin)\n- Login, dashboard, events list + editor + RSVP viewer, COTM editor with archive, newsletter subscriber view + export.\n\nTooling\n- migrations/ has the D1 schema and an optional seed mirroring the wireframe content.\n- scripts/create-staff.mjs bootstraps a staff account via wrangler.\n- README documents local dev (wrangler pages dev + Vite) and deploy steps.","tree":{"sha":"04f98f7b0c10567233cd82e908e228b303440d97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/trees/04f98f7b0c10567233cd82e908e228b303440d97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jking323/jimmys-main/git/commits/b86ba1cc3f36e7f2c5b1ba1e75564765cd0f3bc4","verification":{"payload":"tree 04f98f7b0c10567233cd82e908e228b303440d97\nparent 00d8ed24c633a042086d9049969cda468cd3b1df\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778854477 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778872517 +0000\n\nScaffold backend + management portal\n\nStack: Vite + React frontend, Cloudflare Pages Functions, D1 (SQLite).\n\nFrontend\n- Migrate the existing Babel-standalone components into ES modules under src/.\n- Single SPA with React Router; /admin/* is the staff portal.\n- Public Events, Cigar of the Month, RSVPs and newsletter signup now hit the API.\n\nBackend (functions/api)\n- Public endpoints: events list/detail, RSVP, current cigar of the month, newsletter subscribe.\n- Admin endpoints (gated by _middleware.js): events CRUD, RSVP list + CSV, COTM CRUD + set-current, subscriber list + unsubscribe + CSV.\n- Auth: email + password with PBKDF2-SHA256 hashing and httpOnly session cookies stored in D1.\n\nPortal (src/admin)\n- Login, dashboard, events list + editor + RSVP viewer, COTM editor with archive, newsletter subscriber view + export.\n\nTooling\n- migrations/ has the D1 schema and an optional seed mirroring the wireframe content.\n- scripts/create-staff.mjs bootstraps a staff account via wrangler.\n- README documents local dev (wrangler pages dev + Vite) and deploy steps.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCqwwR9P\norCcQB2eSkJnCOd0DATopA5CIBuorFu73pwPQz2wepedcKreAWmuQ1nZ7K5uwCPkSTuScH7qIL4y\nLQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T19:15:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use