"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commit/52bdee31007391e3456172a5a928804697bd5ada","node_id":"C_kwDOSetEtNoAKDUyYmRlZTMxMDA3MzkxZTM0NTYxNzJhNWE5Mjg4MDQ2OTdiZDVhZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commit/2a8eb97ad046a463fe86509be457dae18d47ae6d","sha":"2a8eb97ad046a463fe86509be457dae18d47ae6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/2a8eb97ad046a463fe86509be457dae18d47ae6d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commit/8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0","sha":"8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0"}],"sha":"52bdee31007391e3456172a5a928804697bd5ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/52bdee31007391e3456172a5a928804697bd5ada"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:33:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:33:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix white screen on / when unauthenticated\n\nAppLayout returned null when there was no user, which caused a white\nscreen at any layout-wrapped route (including /) for unauthenticated\nvisitors.  HomeRedirect inside the layout never got a chance to send\nthem to /login because the layout itself rendered nothing.\n\nMake AppLayout redirect to /login when there''s no user, and show a\nspinner while AuthContext is still verifying the stored token.","tree":{"sha":"899b43b38caa1610d940bec5c029b993ae2714ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/git/trees/899b43b38caa1610d940bec5c029b993ae2714ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/git/commits/8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 899b43b38caa1610d940bec5c029b993ae2714ed\nparent 0c101947a5aaad25fcdacf54c21bf3a7ceffa979\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778884412 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778884412 +0000\n\nFix white screen on / when unauthenticated\n\nAppLayout returned null when there was no user, which caused a white\nscreen at any layout-wrapped route (including /) for unauthenticated\nvisitors.  HomeRedirect inside the layout never got a chance to send\nthem to /login because the layout itself rendered nothing.\n\nMake AppLayout redirect to /login when there''s no user, and show a\nspinner while AuthContext is still verifying the stored token.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEbg2KUu\nAM/Eay4nUImPHtV0etn5zCExwJLMSMMHpO0AaM1TN8eOHtH5fdH29Kp3yb7WPTBtsh3YDgpOes1O\nNwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T22:33:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commit/8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0","node_id":"C_kwDOSetEtNoAKDhlODg0N2Y1NTU4YmU0MjgwYmZlNWFhYzE4NzllZGI3MzFhYjE3YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commit/0c101947a5aaad25fcdacf54c21bf3a7ceffa979","sha":"0c101947a5aaad25fcdacf54c21bf3a7ceffa979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/0c101947a5aaad25fcdacf54c21bf3a7ceffa979"}],"sha":"8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/8e8847f5558be4280bfe5aac1879edb731ab17b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/commits/0c101947a5aaad25fcdacf54c21bf3a7ceffa979/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:17:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:17:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix white screen in Codespaces: allow forwarded host + wss HMR\n\nVite 5.4 added a strict allowedHosts check that defaults to localhost\nonly.  In Codespaces the browser hits the forwarded URL\n(https://<name>-5173.app.github.dev), which Vite was silently rejecting,\nproducing a white screen.\n\n- vite.config.ts: set allowedHosts: true (harmless in local Docker).\n- vite.config.ts: when CODESPACES env is set, route HMR over wss:443\n  so hot-reload works through the HTTPS tunnel without breaking local\n  Docker users (who keep the default ws://host:5173).\n- docker-compose.yml: pipe the CODESPACES env var through to the\n  frontend container so the conditional in vite.config.ts can see it.","tree":{"sha":"e9cb0a74bbcfd2dfacd72873b65a9315976c0559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/git/trees/e9cb0a74bbcfd2dfacd72873b65a9315976c0559"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedMostafa167/Pharma-Connect/git/commits/0c101947a5aaad25fcdacf54c21bf3a7ceffa979","verification":{"payload":"tree e9cb0a74bbcfd2dfacd72873b65a9315976c0559\nparent e5b809fb10854dfef45211446a90aa02291f8433\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778883432 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778883432 +0000\n\nFix white screen in Codespaces: allow forwarded host + wss HMR\n\nVite 5.4 added a strict allowedHosts check that defaults to localhost\nonly.  In Codespaces the browser hits the forwarded URL\n(https://<name>-5173.app.github.dev), which Vite was silently rejecting,\nproducing a white screen.\n\n- vite.config.ts: set allowedHosts: true (harmless in local Docker).\n- vite.config.ts: when CODESPACES env is set, route HMR over wss:443\n  so hot-reload works through the HTTPS tunnel without breaking local\n  Docker users (who keep the default ws://host:5173).\n- docker-compose.yml: pipe the CODESPACES env var through to the\n  frontend container so the conditional in vite.config.ts can see it.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPBUp4DI\nXm36HIfVEt90YReL/gZz6ZVWb98OkGHHyWZxIv6EWid8daqWemhVkWIW2Qdmk+2VT27OSXr3L7IH\nJA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T22:17:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c