b.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/9205ac499f56040d335806051de18ecaa953e666/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:35:02Z","email":"sendwealth@163.com","name":"sendwealth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:35:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(docs): correct model name drift — GLM-4-Flash is the actual default (#236)\n\nREADME and docs incorrectly claimed GLM-5 as the default model, while\nthe actual code defaults (docker-compose.yml, .env.example, cli.py) all\nuse glm-4-flash. Also fixes an incorrect \"ollama (default)\" claim —\nthe default provider is zhipu.\n\nChanges:\n- README.md: GLM-5 (default) → GLM-4-Flash (default), GLM-5 (upgrade)\n- README.md: \"ollama (default)\" → \"zhipu (default, GLM-4-Flash)\"\n- docs/ROADMAP.md: annotate GLM-4-Flash default + GLM-5 upgrade\n- docs/DEPLOYMENT-AND-OPERATIONS.md: split GLM row into default + upgrade\n- docs/i18n/README.zh-CN.md: same fixes as English README\n- CHANGELOG.md: 智谱GLM-5 → 智谱GLM with default/upgrade annotation\n- RELEASE_BODY.md: GLM-5 → GLM with default annotation\n\nCloses SEN-781\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"5b2700a27ffbd867e3f84d846b669c94312bf236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/5b2700a27ffbd867e3f84d846b669c94312bf236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/9205ac499f56040d335806051de18ecaa953e666","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b2700a27ffbd867e3f84d846b669c94312bf236\nparent 6df3fc2fb2c1b30a645e3ae0dd8baeec40c9856b\nauthor sendwealth <sendwealth@163.com> 1782574502 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782574502 +0800\n\nfix(docs): correct model name drift — GLM-4-Flash is the actual default (#236)\n\nREADME and docs incorrectly claimed GLM-5 as the default model, while\nthe actual code defaults (docker-compose.yml, .env.example, cli.py) all\nuse glm-4-flash. Also fixes an incorrect \"ollama (default)\" claim —\nthe default provider is zhipu.\n\nChanges:\n- README.md: GLM-5 (default) → GLM-4-Flash (default), GLM-5 (upgrade)\n- README.md: \"ollama (default)\" → \"zhipu (default, GLM-4-Flash)\"\n- docs/ROADMAP.md: annotate GLM-4-Flash default + GLM-5 upgrade\n- docs/DEPLOYMENT-AND-OPERATIONS.md: split GLM row into default + upgrade\n- docs/i18n/README.zh-CN.md: same fixes as English README\n- CHANGELOG.md: 智谱GLM-5 → 智谱GLM with default/upgrade annotation\n- RELEASE_BODY.md: GLM-5 → GLM with default annotation\n\nCloses SEN-781\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqP+2mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYsgQABpT0uXyo/JTVmid/HKyScyJ\n3Je3BoRT4c7ok+yLXrwIW52DuJKoJVrIxO/5iwGFKLmOAyB9M7kKbJlqIHupvfP9\nAya74OfUNS6Q8GBPoiFIMWCMG1Sh1pOkkC/BJzmxsH7NN3VqNrnKFkW2yBpkWmvq\nj3PpCe51lsv/7XKfy98wOFbxTHuZgXRwrzDBMY9d1elT9J5JDQn9GU8KSFj+uO7I\nsAUhYAGDn5ifVyMRDCFWF8KblQ9XT8GtmxQ+c6wKT7Gm7YdWZo6HgwkFOY9pQ6DG\nvySMdapiDJzhK68h4L0UgSbzkbP28EGVZXuDJ+k9dxO9JD9h9Y9RIxAbMg2i8NCa\nGKiW+e2I9raAnLKBZwbdr4MSw7UUNWHU8O289teZI4Vys1Mh7aGyjTnZWpllxZCx\nmjM0do+Mc/lDEFk7clJ4BsiICJjggjvxoEll4tt5UgXvub5xk1poMNbfFXzLAOsR\nwB7eX3WBnwNo8a61/Dzt4eJfTGbhN97SB8aUxi/PVXo1vLwVEHZRnh2cETaZUPcx\nFmp2OuOOXVly/ykiLCdLP9bwTS4tYTflrVohzlesZS2r4EfIn2zMX1Z60+HTlJZh\nwpn0PJ8+xqJ2nqdrXBPcCkf5fyuR5l4jGOSxrRlK03SHkGiK15OUeZiQkrmoupZh\n0VTUkHLSVhZep3mowGZa\n=XLOD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T15:35:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api