o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/4fc0a9c155f0fbc1d7b9b5da440595f0e303d507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T13:34:45Z","email":"sendwealth@163.com","name":"sendwealth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T13:34:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(llm): close httpx.AsyncClient on provider shutdown and hot-swap (#234)\n\nFix two httpx.AsyncClient leaks:\n1. agent_loop.py: LLMProvider''s httpx client was never closed during\n   agent shutdown — now closes after LLMQueue.stop()\n2. think_loop.py: model hot-swap replaced the old provider without\n   calling close() — now closes old provider after swap\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"e77354a871e47efbeec5c606246476b0f84411bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/e77354a871e47efbeec5c606246476b0f84411bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/4fc0a9c155f0fbc1d7b9b5da440595f0e303d507","verification":{"payload":"tree e77354a871e47efbeec5c606246476b0f84411bf\nparent e4db612c1af095ea38aa0152c9e1b50907dd89bd\nauthor sendwealth <sendwealth@163.com> 1782567285 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782567285 +0800\n\nfix(llm): close httpx.AsyncClient on provider shutdown and hot-swap (#234)\n\nFix two httpx.AsyncClient leaks:\n1. agent_loop.py: LLMProvider''s httpx client was never closed during\n   agent shutdown — now closes after LLMQueue.stop()\n2. think_loop.py: model hot-swap replaced the old provider without\n   calling close() — now closes old provider after swap\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthr