ttps://api.github.com/users/oklaM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/21ef2be59590c65fcfc8d3cb265bf39c14791984/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T09:40:33Z","email":"675475355@qq.com","name":"oklaM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T09:40:33Z","email":"675475355@qq.com","name":"oklaM"},"message":"fix: change max_consecutive_errors default from 0 (unlimited) to 20\n\nA default of 0 meant broken agents would retry forever, consuming\nresources. Now defaults to 20, marks the agent DEAD when the limit\nis reached, and logs warnings at the 50% threshold.\n\n- ThinkLoopConfig.max_consecutive_errors: 0 → 20\n- config.py _parse_think_loop_config fallback: 0 → 20\n- On limit reached: set agent phase to DEAD before stopping\n- Log consecutive/total error counts in the termination message\n- Warn at 50% threshold for proactive monitoring\n- Update test_defaults and test_consecutive_error_limit accordingly\n\nCloses SEN-775\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"e4b33648bcdb170299f9315f69c332c425fce98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/e4b33648bcdb170299f9315f69c332c425fce98a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/21ef2be59590c65fcfc8d3cb265bf39c14791984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25482029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oklaM