type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/ba29727cac87fafdaaf0e317b24e26795659fcb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T18:48:13Z","email":"675475355@qq.com","name":"oklaM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T18:49:01Z","email":"675475355@qq.com","name":"oklaM"},"message":"Fix P0: perception endpoint queries dynamic world map instead of hardcoded resources\n\nReplaces hardcoded nearby_resources in get_agent_perception with a\nreal lookup against a seeded WorldMap. The map is generated in main.rs\nusing the deterministic seeder (seed=42) — a 20x20 hex grid with\nresources placed on tiles. Different agent positions now see different\nresources based on their hex-ring proximity.\n\nChanges:\n- api.rs: add WorldMap field to AppState + TestOverrides\n- api_agents_ext.rs: dynamic perception query via HexPos ring()\n- main.rs: seed world map with terrain + resources, wire into AppState\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n1. nearby_resources derived from WorldMap + agent position\n2. Different positions yield different resource sets\n3. Empty map returns empty list\n4. Resource coordinates match world map offsets\n5. cargo test passes (1348 lib + 200+ integration)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"266acb7fbf7105138725a2853d65ae32812e22ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/266acb7fbf7105138725a2853d65ae32812e22ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/ba29727cac87fafdaaf0e317b24e26795659fcb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25482029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okl