"Add global rate limiting for 10 agents hitting GLM-4-Flash (P0)\n\nThis addresses the P0 issue where 10 agents running LLM calls at 1 Hz\nexceeded the GLM-4-Flash gateway rate limit, causing repeated 429 errors.\n\nChanges:\n- Add cross-process global rate limiter using file-lock token bucket\n  (LLM_RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=1, LLM_RATE_LIMIT_RATE=2.0, burst=4)\n- Add 429 retry with exponential backoff in OpenAI and Anthropic providers\n- Gate LLMQueue dispatch through the rate limiter before concurrency semaphore\n- Raise default tick_interval from 1.0s to 5.0s in all 100 agent configs\n- Allow env-var override: LLM_MAX_RETRIES, LLM_MIN_BACKOFF_SECONDS,\n  LLM_MAX_BACKOFF_SECONDS, LLM_JITTER_FACTOR, LLM_RATE_LIMIT_RATE,\n  LLM_RATE_LIMIT_BURST, LLM_RATE_LIMIT_PATH\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"81ed214e3d2b6434a908a243db1c92eeb0389ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/81ed214e3d2b6434a908a243db1c92eeb0389ac1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/52d5948b2a17c08cca21ba101a1122bc7fbe7494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25482029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oklaM","id":25482029,"login":"oklaM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDgyMDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oklaM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth/agent-world/commit/52d5948b2a17c08cca21ba101a1122bc7fbe7494","node_id":"C_kwDOSeu2iNoAKDUyZDU5NDhiMmExN2MwOGNjYTIxYmExMDFhMTEyMmJjN2ZiZTc0OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth/agent-world/commit/ba463ea6880f66c2091444f6a335cb7a07210374","sha":"ba463ea6880f66c2091444f6a335cb7a07210374","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/ba463ea6880f66c2091444f6a335cb7a07210374"}],"sha":"52d5948b2a17c08cca21ba101a1122bc7fbe7494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/52d5948b2a17c08cca21ba101a1122bc7fbe7494"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261151873?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth","id":261151873,"login":"sendwealth","node_id":"U_kgDOD5DcgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/ba463ea6880f66c2091444f6a335cb7a07210374/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:04:39Z","email":"sendwealth@163.com","name":"sendwealth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:04:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(engine): implement 9 empty action arms with real side effects (#195)\n\nImplement fully functional match arms for explore, communicate, trade,\nbuild, claim_task, submit_task, socialize, practice_skill, and teach_skill\nactions in api_agents_ext.rs. Each action has real subsystem interactions\n(TaskBoard, BuildingManager, TrustNetwork, EventBus) with proper token\neconomics, parameter validation, error handling, and event emission.\n\nAdded 14 integration tests covering happy paths, parameter validation\nerrors (400s), and subsystem interaction verification.\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"6f21d93967f3f6ff1687228c7dc310b8ad4e8a72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/6f21d93967f3f6ff1687228c7dc310b8ad4e8a72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/ba463ea6880f66c2091444f6a335cb7a07210374","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f21d93967f3f6ff1687228c7dc310b8ad4e8a72\nparent 6d26511c05df8335dbf6436ef58b25eb820479f5\nauthor sendwealth <sendwealth@163.com> 1782320679 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782320679 +0800\n\nfeat(engine): implement 9 empty action arms with real side effects (#195)\n\nImplement fully functional match arms for explore, communicate, trade,\nbuild, claim_task, submit_task, socialize, practice_skill, and teach_skill\nactions in api_agents_ext.rs. Each action has real subsystem interactions\n(TaskBoard, BuildingManager, TrustNetwork, EventBus) with proper token\neconomics, parameter validation, error handling, and event emission.\n\nAdded 14 integration tests covering happy paths, parameter validation\nerrors (400s), and subsystem interaction verification.\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <nor