uide.\n\n- Add a poster frame (docs/screenshots/documentary-poster.png) from the sample film.\n\n- Mark the 5.4 milestone ✅ in docs/ROADMAP.md and annotate the DoD.\n\nSample film verified: 180s (3:00), 1600x900, 4 chapters, Chinese narration, produced via `make documentary` (--scene-duration 20).\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOBWuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPlEQAIbGnORbDJbn/92Vd+oz8jRp\nSoUqldz2epV7A0uAutZZ9LLCPuA2/nShUfBm0ILvku4a/B+vvC9cBT57jufrzGaw\nsHK10HSghMRG/wmE3Tdfbdz8yTIe9OJC/wm2DpOwien9m1fn0R3xemokXtMkZQEF\nzBIQ+h9P/iWg55F4GJdv8umVBRcMj0qynhmqMF7zMuJmTYrknevYzsgC0n5qab9p\n3WRoJuzXzxad9K0+Ehjr53pJk4NkRvLvHJNymgtDKoiNRH+jayNfenNMDj4i+zel\n/s9o5tJq7pHF8RmaOZRgP9ylGaSOc1A+YZmdJARR6WWWE4S4du3H13xnjUtzlN52\nAjwKDZw+D0At+lfIXt2NDCZQ8a4hZCunR8GhL1OKmDbEXm78lcRdhYDG05ZBFt1Z\npNT1NlD1gLcC4/TGz3MbUoEGVVSTaexnUSDikTB1Cr8AGxyU33wOQGjqyN4dPq65\nm7ouv7zcUHcVQtqmTIowqaQApp4Xn+kX4hmjcDiJ9eBHnkhk1y6pqNCY1Ob7NHNC\nW6IJv5dzWLvTNlQy7wHwpqPTmuuxKxzpfBBzENWnf5nJRXGgvtqksZNcZYcxvMD9\njZyPDybasDSRS9I0kKJ+CAORQUn/lgSZtnnPR+dV3tXoyoLvKa0o8embJegauGAb\nWotDLf5V5FsiMIK7im3K\n=nfWH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T16:47:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth/agent-world/commit/6ca47deb9cc9b0c190e8f75da2030fddff791923","node_id":"C_kwDOSeu2iNoAKDZjYTQ3ZGViOWNjOWIwYzE5MGU4Zjc1ZGEyMDMwZmRkZmY3OTE5MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth/agent-world/commit/9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac","sha":"9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac"}],"sha":"6ca47deb9cc9b0c190e8f75da2030fddff791923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/6ca47deb9cc9b0c190e8f75da2030fddff791923"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261151873?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth","id":261151873,"login":"sendwealth","node_id":"U_kgDOD5DcgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:16:53Z","email":"sendwealth@163.com","name":"sendwealth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:16:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(stocks): add price history endpoint and wire dashboard to real data (#191)\n\nAdd `GET /api/v1/stocks/:id/history` which aggregates per-tick trade\ndata (price + volume) from the existing `list_trades` method. The\ndashboard now fetches history for each listed stock in parallel and\nderives `change` / `changePercent` from the first and last history\npoints, so sparklines and AreaCharts render real price trends instead\nof flat lines.\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"ff9e6eef39692767359860f33a92bab262f1e1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/ff9e6eef39692767359860f33a92bab262f1e1da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac","verification":{"payload":"tree ff9e6eef39692767359860f33a92bab262f1e1da\nparent 90b158c45f08e56d0c04732ec7ce9973e8b32579\nauthor sendwealth <sendwealth@163.com> 1781983013 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781983013 +0800\n\nfeat(stocks): add price history endpoint and wire dashboard to real data (#191)\n\nAdd `GET /api/v1/stocks/:id/history` which aggregates per-tick trade\ndata (price + volume) from the existing `list_trades` method. The\ndashboard now fetches history for each listed stock in parallel and\nderives `change` / `changePercent` from the first and last history\npoints, so sparklines and AreaCharts render real price trends instead\nof flat lines.\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNuclCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4QcQADWXtACVBvs6aF