f08e56d0c04732ec7ce9973e8b32579","sha":"90b158c45f08e56d0c04732ec7ce9973e8b32579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/90b158c45f08e56d0c04732ec7ce9973e8b32579"}],"sha":"9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/9ef61d85f60dfa3f3ca1738d0fbf3c1381ab87ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261151873?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sendwealth","id":261151873,"login":"sendwealth","node_id":"U_kgDOD5DcgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sendwealth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/commits/90b158c45f08e56d0c04732ec7ce9973e8b32579/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T18:48:18Z","email":"sendwealth@163.com","name":"sendwealth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T18:48:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(stocks): replace Math.random mock data with real backend API (#190)\n\nDashboard stocks page was fabricating prices and history with\nMath.random() despite the world-engine having a complete stock\nmarket API. Switch the data source to GET /api/v1/stocks and align\nthe TypeScript types with the backend StockResponse shape.\n\n- Remove generateStockData(); replace with toStockData() that maps\n  raw StockResponse rows into the existing view-model\n- Add StockResponse type (mirrors Rust StockResponse) and document\n  why change/volume/history are zeroed client-side\n- Drop the \"placeholder until backend stock API is available\" note\n- Filter to status === \"listed\" only\n- Friendly empty state: \"暂无上市股票 — 当组织满足 IPO 条件后股票\n  将在此显示\"\n- Guard sparkline division when history has a single data point\n\nSEN-731\n\nCo-authored-by: oklaM <675475355@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: multica-agent <github@multica.ai>","tree":{"sha":"a38803e3d18501e8aabefa8db92bdbec8769f9ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/trees/a38803e3d18501e8aabefa8db92bdbec8769f9ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sendwealth/agent-world/git/commits/90b158c45f08e56d0c04732ec7ce9973e8b32579","verification":{"payload":"tree a38803e3d18501e8aabefa8db92bdbec8769f9ed\nparent 7f9c0ec9b108e18139acb77f70de461f791a7cbd\nauthor sendwealth <sendwealth@163.com> 1781981298 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781981298 +0800\n\nfix(stocks): replace Math.random mock data with real backend API (#190)\n\nDashboard stocks page was fabricating prices and history with\nMath.random() despite the world-engine having a complete stock\nmarket API. Switch the data source to GET /api/v1/stocks and align\nthe TypeScript types with the backend StockResponse shape.\n\n- Remove generateStockData(); replace with toStockData() that maps\n  raw StockResponse rows into the existing view-model\n- Add StockResponse type (mirrors Rust StockResponse) and document\n  why change/volume/history are zeroed client-side\n- Drop the \"placeholder until backend stock API is available\" note\n- Filter to status === \"listed\" only\n- Friendly empty state: \"暂无上市股票 — 当组织满足 IPO 条件后股票\n  将在此显示\"\n- Guard sparkline division when history has a single data point\n\nSEN-731\n\nCo-authored-by: okl