 with exact causality sequence\n- Add ExecutionIntelligenceService for 8-layer event processing pipeline\n- Create narrative builder services (StoryBuilderService, NarrativeBuilderService)\n- Add specialized services: RootCauseDetectorService, ImpactAnalyzerService, InsightEngineService\n- Implement SessionBuilderService and ExecutionScoreService for session management\n- Add supporting services: EventNormalizerService, DiffEngineService, MetricsGlossaryService\n- Create new ExecutionNarrative and ExecutionIntelligence type definitions\n- Add MetricsHelp component for context-sensitive guidance\n- Update Rendering Inspector UI with execution explorer integration\n- Update toolbar with execution explorer navigation\n- Update flow-tracker instrumentation for enhanced event capture\n- Add comprehensive documentation (17 new markdown files covering design, verification, and implementation)\n- Replaces raw event inspection with business-domain narrative intelligence showing intent and causality","tree":{"sha":"94e45edbba3a21d1b38ece6468a6abc26f0ab6d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/patch-work-book/nglens/git/trees/94e45edbba3a21d1b38ece6468a6abc26f0ab6d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/patch-work-book/nglens/git/commits/32ec293b8f1371322d48042088d4d7b5f61d1da1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5539186?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gowthambalashanmugam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gowthambalashanmugam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gowthambalashanmugam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gowthambalashanmugam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gowthambalashanmugam","id":5539186,"login":"gowthambalashanmugam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzkxODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user